<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:00.100" end="00:00:02.500" style="s2">One guy just left because my family&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:00:01.500" end="00:00:03.900" style="s2">poor.</p>
<p begin="00:00:02.500" end="00:00:05.600" style="s2">Now here comes another.</p>
<p begin="00:00:03.900" end="00:00:06.600" style="s2">Looks honest, but who knows if he&#39;s just</p>
<p begin="00:00:05.600" end="00:00:08.300" style="s2">putting on an act.</p>
<p begin="00:00:06.600" end="00:00:10.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m Xu Chaoyang. I sell breakfast at the</p>
<p begin="00:00:08.300" end="00:00:11.600" style="s2">Heping Road morning market. Matchmaker</p>
<p begin="00:00:10.300" end="00:00:12.500" style="s2">gave me the address and told me to come</p>
<p begin="00:00:11.600" end="00:00:13.600" style="s2">straight here.</p>
<p begin="00:00:12.500" end="00:00:14.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The matchmaker said you work at a</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.600" end="00:00:16.400" style="s2">restaurant?</p>
<p begin="00:00:14.100" end="00:00:18.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah. I&#39;m a waitress.</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.400" end="00:00:20.300" style="s2">Aren&#39;t you going to ask anything?</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.600" end="00:00:22.500" style="s2">You don&#39;t mind that I don&#39;t earn much or</p>
<p begin="00:00:20.300" end="00:00:24.700" style="s2">that my family lives like this?</p>
<p begin="00:00:22.500" end="00:00:27.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What would I mind? I sell breakfast.</p>
<p begin="00:00:24.700" end="00:00:29.200" style="s2">Would you look down on me?</p>
<p begin="00:00:27.400" end="00:00:31.300" style="s2">Then there you go. No job is better than</p>
<p begin="00:00:29.200" end="00:00:32.800" style="s2">another. We earn our money with our own</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.300" end="00:00:33.900" style="s2">two hands. There&#39;s nothing shameful</p>
<p begin="00:00:32.800" end="00:00:35.700" style="s2">about that.</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.900" end="00:00:38.645" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s the first guy who&#39;s seen my family</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.700" end="00:00:40.665" style="s2">set up and not look down on us at all.</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.645" end="00:00:40.665" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [bell]</p>
<p begin="00:00:42.200" end="00:00:45.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fresh grounds, no sugar. Figured you</p>
<p begin="00:00:44.200" end="00:00:47.400" style="s2">girls might be watching your weight.</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.500" end="00:00:47.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you this thoughtful with every blind</p>
<p begin="00:00:47.400" end="00:00:51.200" style="s2">date?</p>
<p begin="00:00:47.800" end="00:00:51.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is my first blind date.</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.400" end="00:00:55.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, there are a few things I&#39;d like to</p>
<p begin="00:00:52.800" end="00:00:55.900" style="s2">ask you first. How much do you actually</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.000" end="00:00:58.600" style="s2">make a month?</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.900" end="00:01:00.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here it comes. 4,500.</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.600" end="00:01:01.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How much do you owe on credit cards or</p>
<p begin="00:01:00.200" end="00:01:02.400" style="s2">other loans?</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.400" end="00:01:04.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.400" end="00:01:07.600" style="s2">I spend what I earn. Half of what&#39;s left</p>
<p begin="00:01:04.400" end="00:01:07.600" style="s2">goes toward my mom&#39;s medicine.</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.700" end="00:01:09.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you go clubbing?</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.700" end="00:01:11.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.700" end="00:01:12.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you drink often?</p>
<p begin="00:01:11.000" end="00:01:14.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just a little, now and then at work</p>
<p begin="00:01:12.200" end="00:01:16.400" style="s2">dinners. Not much.</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.200" end="00:01:18.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you careless with money? I mean, do</p>
<p begin="00:01:16.400" end="00:01:19.600" style="s2">you live paycheck to paycheck, buying</p>
<p begin="00:01:18.100" end="00:01:21.000" style="s2">bags and clothes on credit?</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.600" end="00:01:23.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t even afford a new outfit every</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.000" end="00:01:24.500" style="s2">month. I make enough, but I have to</p>
<p begin="00:01:23.400" end="00:01:26.100" style="s2">watch every penny.</p>
<p begin="00:01:24.500" end="00:01:28.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And have you completely moved on from</p>
<p begin="00:01:26.100" end="00:01:29.800" style="s2">your ex?</p>
<p begin="00:01:28.500" end="00:01:31.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Completely.</p>
<p begin="00:01:29.800" end="00:01:33.500" style="s2">He got what he wanted.</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.300" end="00:01:34.800" style="s2">We&#39;re even now.</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.500" end="00:01:35.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. You seem like a decent</p>
<p begin="00:01:34.800" end="00:01:37.400" style="s2">person.</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.800" end="00:01:38.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean all right?</p>
<p begin="00:01:37.400" end="00:01:41.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A low income is fine. We can work our</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.900" end="00:01:42.200" style="s2">way up. If your family struggles, we can</p>
<p begin="00:01:41.000" end="00:01:43.700" style="s2">share the burden.</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.200" end="00:01:45.200" style="s2">But if someone has bad habits they can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.700" end="00:01:47.500" style="s2">shake, they&#39;re not cut out for building</p>
<p begin="00:01:45.200" end="00:01:49.000" style="s2">a life together.</p>
<p begin="00:01:47.500" end="00:01:50.900" style="s2">I can handle a tough life, even if we&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:01:49.000" end="00:01:52.800" style="s2">short on money, but I won&#39;t accept</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.900" end="00:01:54.500" style="s2">gambling, debt, or other bad habits.</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.800" end="00:01:56.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So that&#39;s what matters to him. What</p>
<p begin="00:01:54.500" end="00:01:58.700" style="s2">about you? How much do you make a month?</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.700" end="00:02:00.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I sell steamed buns. I make around 300</p>
<p begin="00:01:58.700" end="00:02:01.492" style="s2">yuan a day, but after there&#39;s not much</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.792" end="00:02:02.592" style="s2">left.</p>
<p begin="00:02:01.492" end="00:02:04.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about your place?</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.592" end="00:02:06.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I rent an old little house, nothing</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.192" end="00:02:07.692" style="s2">fancy, but it&#39;s enough.</p>
<p begin="00:02:06.092" end="00:02:08.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aren&#39;t you worried I&#39;ll have my eye on</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.692" end="00:02:10.192" style="s2">your business?</p>
<p begin="00:02:08.592" end="00:02:11.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go ahead. The most valuable thing at my</p>
<p begin="00:02:10.192" end="00:02:13.892" style="s2">stall is that pot. You&#39;d better hold on</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.992" end="00:02:15.092" style="s2">to that 4,500 yuan salary of yours</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.892" end="00:02:16.692" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.092" end="00:02:18.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xia Shu,</p>
<p begin="00:02:16.692" end="00:02:20.692" style="s2">let me ask you something honestly. You</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.592" end="00:02:23.692" style="s2">don&#39;t mind that Jisha has to care for</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.692" end="00:02:23.692" style="s2">her paralyzed mother?</p>
<p begin="00:02:23.792" end="00:02:27.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do.</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.592" end="00:02:28.492" style="s2">Who doesn&#39;t want a better life?</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.292" end="00:02:30.292" style="s2">But feeling like the circumstances</p>
<p begin="00:02:28.492" end="00:02:31.992" style="s2">aren&#39;t ideal doesn&#39;t mean we can&#39;t keep</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.292" end="00:02:33.892" style="s2">getting to know each other.</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.992" end="00:02:35.492" style="s2">You can&#39;t judge someone by their income.</p>
<p begin="00:02:33.892" end="00:02:37.092" style="s2">You have to look at who they are. If</p>
<p begin="00:02:35.492" end="00:02:38.992" style="s2">they&#39;re honest and hardworking with no</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.092" end="00:02:40.692" style="s2">bad habits, they can always work their</p>
<p begin="00:02:38.992" end="00:02:41.592" style="s2">way up, even if they don&#39;t earn much</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.692" end="00:02:43.192" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:02:41.592" end="00:02:45.092" style="s2">But if they don&#39;t have good character,</p>
<p begin="00:02:43.192" end="00:02:47.692" style="s2">money doesn&#39;t mean a thing.</p>
<p begin="00:02:45.092" end="00:02:49.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It wasn&#39;t exactly romantic, but somehow</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.692" end="00:02:51.792" style="s2">his words felt more genuine than all the</p>
<p begin="00:02:49.492" end="00:02:53.592" style="s2">sweet talk I&#39;d ever heard.</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.792" end="00:02:55.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You two don&#39;t have to sit here all day.</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.592" end="00:02:57.292" style="s2">Go out for a walk. Get to know each</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.192" end="00:02:59.792" style="s2">other.</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.292" end="00:03:01.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How about I take you out to eat?</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.792" end="00:03:02.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can eat later. Get on. I&#39;ll let you</p>
<p begin="00:03:01.592" end="00:03:05.092" style="s2">try my cooking.</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.692" end="00:03:05.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.692" end="00:03:09.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.992" end="00:03:12.092" style="s2">I&#39;ve been handling flour. I don&#39;t want</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.292" end="00:03:13.892" style="s2">to get your pants dirty.</p>
<p begin="00:03:12.092" end="00:03:14.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your hands are covered in flour, but</p>
<p begin="00:03:13.892" end="00:03:17.292" style="s2">you&#39;re more considerate than most</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.892" end="00:03:17.292" style="s2">people.</p>
<p begin="00:03:23.292" end="00:03:25.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold on to</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.892" end="00:03:34.292" style="s2">Grandma, let go. I&#39;ve got it.</p>
<p begin="00:03:34.592" end="00:03:37.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here, let me give you a hand.</p>
<p begin="00:03:35.892" end="00:03:37.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For a restaurant server, you&#39;re pretty</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.092" end="00:03:40.992" style="s2">strong.</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.692" end="00:03:40.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Carrying trays builds muscle.</p>
<p begin="00:03:42.292" end="00:03:46.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you. Thank you. If it weren&#39;t for</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.392" end="00:03:49.192" style="s2">you two, my whole cart of boxes would</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.792" end="00:03:50.492" style="s2">have ended up in the ditch.</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.192" end="00:03:52.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandma, don&#39;t load it so full next</p>
<p begin="00:03:50.492" end="00:03:53.492" style="s2">time. It&#39;s heavy going uphill and even</p>
<p begin="00:03:52.392" end="00:03:55.792" style="s2">more dangerous going down.</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.492" end="00:03:56.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here, kids, take these. They&#39;re from my</p>
<p begin="00:03:55.792" end="00:03:57.992" style="s2">own tree.</p>
<p begin="00:03:56.492" end="00:03:59.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, Grandma, keep them and sell them for</p>
<p begin="00:03:57.992" end="00:04:01.892" style="s2">some money. We&#39;re off.</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.592" end="00:04:02.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Such a good boy.</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.892" end="00:04:04.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You run to help people</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.694" end="00:04:06.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; in trouble faster than you&#39;d run after</p>
<p begin="00:04:04.394" end="00:04:08.494" style="s2">money.</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.494" end="00:04:10.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; was just a quick hand. My dad used to</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.494" end="00:04:11.894" style="s2">say, your strength is in your hands. If</p>
<p begin="00:04:10.294" end="00:04:13.094" style="s2">you don&#39;t use it, it&#39;ll rust.</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.894" end="00:04:14.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The way you go out of your way to help</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.094" end="00:04:16.694" style="s2">people.</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.394" end="00:04:17.994" style="s2">You can&#39;t fake that.</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.694" end="00:04:19.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold on tight. The alley up ahead is</p>
<p begin="00:04:17.994" end="00:04:21.494" style="s2">bumpy.</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.894" end="00:04:25.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. If I fall, I&#39;ll take</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.494" end="00:04:25.294" style="s2">responsibility. You won&#39;t have to pay.</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.194" end="00:04:34.294" style="s2">You know that kid?</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.694" end="00:04:34.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. But I used to be that hungry too.</p>
<p begin="00:04:40.794" end="00:04:46.194" style="s2">Come try what I made. Red bean or pork</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.194" end="00:04:46.194" style="s2">fresh from the steamer.</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.794" end="00:04:51.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Delicious. Even better than Fumanlou&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:04:50.094" end="00:04:53.294" style="s2">signature pastries.</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.094" end="00:04:54.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You bet. I learned from my dad. Get the</p>
<p begin="00:04:53.294" end="00:04:55.094" style="s2">timing off by even a minute and it&#39;s not</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.894" end="00:04:56.794" style="s2">right.</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.094" end="00:04:58.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With skills like yours, it&#39;s a shame you</p>
<p begin="00:04:56.794" end="00:05:00.094" style="s2">don&#39;t open a proper restaurant.</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.094" end="00:05:02.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A big restaurant has its perks, but this</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.094" end="00:05:03.694" style="s2">little stand has its own purpose.</p>
<p begin="00:05:02.094" end="00:05:05.494" style="s2">The folks on this street, the aunties,</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.694" end="00:05:07.394" style="s2">uncles, and sanitation workers, they</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.494" end="00:05:08.394" style="s2">grab my buns on their way to work. If I</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.394" end="00:05:10.694" style="s2">leave, what will they eat in the</p>
<p begin="00:05:08.394" end="00:05:10.694" style="s2">morning?</p>
<p begin="00:05:14.494" end="00:05:17.894" style="s2">Don&#39;t move. What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:05:19.894" end="00:05:25.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So he&#39;s just like everyone else,</p>
<p begin="00:05:21.494" end="00:05:25.494" style="s2">disgusted by how dirty that old man is.</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.694" end="00:05:28.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandpa Ma, how many times have I told</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.294" end="00:05:31.694" style="s2">you? The ground&#39;s dirty. You&#39;ll get a</p>
<p begin="00:05:28.694" end="00:05:31.694" style="s2">stomach ache if you eat that.</p>
<p begin="00:05:31.894" end="00:05:33.694" style="s2">I save some for you every day.</p>
<p begin="00:05:33.394" end="00:05:35.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here.</p>
<p begin="00:05:33.694" end="00:05:36.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There are so many people here today. I</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.694" end="00:05:38.694" style="s2">didn&#39;t want to be a bother.</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.794" end="00:05:40.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What bother? These split buns won&#39;t sell</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.694" end="00:05:41.094" style="s2">anyway. It&#39;d be a shame to throw them</p>
<p begin="00:05:40.194" end="00:05:44.594" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.094" end="00:05:44.594" style="s2">Have a seat. I&#39;ll get you some soy milk.</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.394" end="00:05:52.894" style="s2">Take your time. When you&#39;re done, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.194" end="00:05:55.194" style="s2">pack you some to take home. You can warm</p>
<p begin="00:05:52.894" end="00:05:57.694" style="s2">them up tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:05:55.194" end="00:05:59.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shoes never sells the split buns. He</p>
<p begin="00:05:57.694" end="00:06:00.494" style="s2">saves them for Grandpa Ma and the</p>
<p begin="00:05:59.494" end="00:06:03.994" style="s2">others.</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.494" end="00:06:06.895" style="s2">Rain or shine for two years straight.</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.994" end="00:06:08.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shuchao Yang, I&#39;m sorry. I almost</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.895" end="00:06:09.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t care what you were thinking.</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.195" end="00:06:11.395" style="s2">Right now, give me a hand. We&#39;re almost</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.895" end="00:06:13.095" style="s2">sold out.</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.395" end="00:06:15.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I almost accused the kindest person I</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.095" end="00:06:15.495" style="s2">know.</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.695" end="00:06:18.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take these home for your parents to try.</p>
<p begin="00:06:17.395" end="00:06:19.995" style="s2">Your mom has to watch what she eats</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.495" end="00:06:23.395" style="s2">while she&#39;s bedridden, so I made a batch</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.995" end="00:06:23.395" style="s2">with less oil and salt just for her.</p>
<p begin="00:06:45.995" end="00:06:49.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Morning, Shu.</p>
<p begin="00:06:47.295" end="00:06:51.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Morning, Auntie Li. Have some more.</p>
<p begin="00:06:49.695" end="00:06:52.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shu, I drink your tea every day. I feel</p>
<p begin="00:06:51.895" end="00:06:53.695" style="s2">bad about it.</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.595" end="00:06:55.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re out sweeping the streets before</p>
<p begin="00:06:53.695" end="00:06:58.195" style="s2">dawn. You work harder than I do.</p>
<p begin="00:06:55.995" end="00:06:59.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So this is how he spends every day. It</p>
<p begin="00:06:58.195" end="00:07:02.195" style="s2">starts at 3:00 in the morning.</p>
<p begin="00:06:59.895" end="00:07:04.795" style="s2">While I lay awake in my mansion, he was</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.195" end="00:07:04.795" style="s2">kneading dough.</p>
<p begin="00:07:11.995" end="00:07:16.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You look well today, Miss Shen.</p>
<p begin="00:07:14.995" end="00:07:18.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe I finally got a good night&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:07:16.295" end="00:07:18.695" style="s2">sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.095" end="00:07:29.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Shu, we&#39;re closing up. Could you</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.895" end="00:07:31.995" style="s2">take a look at this bike? The chain came</p>
<p begin="00:07:29.995" end="00:07:34.395" style="s2">off, and my old back can&#39;t bend down</p>
<p begin="00:07:31.995" end="00:07:34.395" style="s2">anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:07:40.995" end="00:07:44.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncle, the chain&#39;s back on. I tightened</p>
<p begin="00:07:42.595" end="00:07:45.595" style="s2">the front brake, too. The brake pads are</p>
<p begin="00:07:44.095" end="00:07:46.595" style="s2">getting thin. I&#39;ll bring you a new set</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.595" end="00:07:48.395" style="s2">next time.</p>
<p begin="00:07:46.595" end="00:07:49.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How much do I owe you?</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.395" end="00:07:52.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was just a quick favor. No need to</p>
<p begin="00:07:49.895" end="00:07:54.595" style="s2">pay me.</p>
<p begin="00:07:52.095" end="00:07:56.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And Wang Xiaolan&#39;s leg.</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.595" end="00:07:58.495" style="s2">She&#39;s been bedridden for a year.</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.595" end="00:08:01.995" style="s2">Her muscles are stiff, and it aches</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.495" end="00:08:01.995" style="s2">whenever the weather turns damp.</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.695" end="00:08:07.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Auntie, my grandma used to have leg</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.195" end="00:08:09.597" style="s2">pain, too. It was so bad she couldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:08:07.897" end="00:08:11.797" style="s2">sleep all night. I&#39;d massage her like</p>
<p begin="00:08:09.597" end="00:08:11.797" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.497" end="00:08:15.697" style="s2">Let me know if I&#39;m pressing too hard.</p>
<p begin="00:08:16.197" end="00:08:19.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Guo Dong.</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.597" end="00:08:20.997" style="s2">When he knelt down to massage my leg,</p>
<p begin="00:08:19.297" end="00:08:21.397" style="s2">there wasn&#39;t a trace of disgust in his</p>
<p begin="00:08:20.997" end="00:08:24.797" style="s2">eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.397" end="00:08:27.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mm. Grease on your hands washes off.</p>
<p begin="00:08:24.797" end="00:08:29.797" style="s2">A clean heart is much rarer.</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.797" end="00:08:32.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve decided. He&#39;s the son-in-law for</p>
<p begin="00:08:29.797" end="00:08:32.097" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:33.897" end="00:08:37.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; President Shen, Yun Qi Bei is full of</p>
<p begin="00:08:35.597" end="00:08:39.397" style="s2">old buildings, high relocation costs,</p>
<p begin="00:08:37.597" end="00:08:40.397" style="s2">long turnaround. I propose we put the</p>
<p begin="00:08:39.397" end="00:08:42.697" style="s2">project on hold.</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.397" end="00:08:46.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. Sinking money there isn&#39;t as</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.697" end="00:08:47.397" style="s2">good as acquiring two clean plots.</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.097" end="00:08:48.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve had my eye on Yun Qi Bei for a</p>
<p begin="00:08:47.397" end="00:08:51.097" style="s2">year.</p>
<p begin="00:08:48.297" end="00:08:53.697" style="s2">Over 2,000 elderly residents live there.</p>
<p begin="00:08:51.097" end="00:08:55.697" style="s2">They can&#39;t afford to wait. I&#39;ll oversee</p>
<p begin="00:08:53.697" end="00:08:56.897" style="s2">this project personally. If anything</p>
<p begin="00:08:55.697" end="00:08:58.497" style="s2">goes wrong, I&#39;ll take full</p>
<p begin="00:08:56.897" end="00:09:00.197" style="s2">responsibility.</p>
<p begin="00:08:58.497" end="00:09:01.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; President Shen always has such unique</p>
<p begin="00:09:00.197" end="00:09:03.997" style="s2">vision. Though I hear you&#39;ve been</p>
<p begin="00:09:01.897" end="00:09:06.597" style="s2">visiting the old district a lot lately.</p>
<p begin="00:09:03.997" end="00:09:07.597" style="s2">A place like that.</p>
<p begin="00:09:06.597" end="00:09:08.897" style="s2">You wouldn&#39;t want to get mixed up in</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.597" end="00:09:10.697" style="s2">trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:09:08.897" end="00:09:12.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Vice President Gu, just focus on your</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.697" end="00:09:13.097" style="s2">own financial reports. Meeting</p>
<p begin="00:09:12.297" end="00:09:14.797" style="s2">adjourned.</p>
<p begin="00:09:13.097" end="00:09:17.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No one rubs my shoulders quite like my</p>
<p begin="00:09:14.797" end="00:09:17.197" style="s2">daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.697" end="00:09:22.797" style="s2">Mom, at the office today, Gu Chang Ze</p>
<p begin="00:09:21.297" end="00:09:24.497" style="s2">was dropping hints.</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.797" end="00:09:27.697" style="s2">It felt like he&#39;s looking into me.</p>
<p begin="00:09:24.497" end="00:09:27.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t hide it for long.</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.297" end="00:09:34.297" style="s2">Chi Xia, think this through carefully.</p>
<p begin="00:09:31.797" end="00:09:37.097" style="s2">Between the project and yourself,</p>
<p begin="00:09:34.297" end="00:09:39.097" style="s2">sooner or later you&#39;ll have to choose.</p>
<p begin="00:09:37.097" end="00:09:41.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That young man, Shu, what do you think</p>
<p begin="00:09:39.097" end="00:09:43.397" style="s2">of him?</p>
<p begin="00:09:41.397" end="00:09:44.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s all right, I guess.</p>
<p begin="00:09:43.397" end="00:09:46.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.597" end="00:09:49.797" style="s2">Growing up, you&#39;ve never used more than</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.297" end="00:09:49.797" style="s2">three words to compliment anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:09:56.897" end="00:10:01.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bro, who is she?</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.597" end="00:10:03.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shen Zhi Xia, I told you about her.</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.097" end="00:10:04.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All dressed up and spotless.</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.097" end="00:10:05.397" style="s2">Is she here to play at working our</p>
<p begin="00:10:04.197" end="00:10:07.597" style="s2">stall?</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.397" end="00:10:09.897" style="s2">Bro, I&#39;m warning you. City girls get</p>
<p begin="00:10:07.597" end="00:10:11.798" style="s2">curious, then lose interest and leave.</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.897" end="00:10:13.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Yu,</p>
<p begin="00:10:11.798" end="00:10:13.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She helped me unload the delivery before</p>
<p begin="00:10:13.098" end="00:10:15.398" style="s2">dawn.</p>
<p begin="00:10:13.998" end="00:10:17.098" style="s2">It took three washes to get the grease</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.398" end="00:10:19.198" style="s2">off her hands.</p>
<p begin="00:10:17.098" end="00:10:21.798" style="s2">I can tell what kind of person she is.</p>
<p begin="00:10:19.198" end="00:10:21.798" style="s2">Don&#39;t be rude.</p>
<p begin="00:10:25.498" end="00:10:28.598" style="s2">Come home for dinner tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.998" end="00:10:32.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go make it up to her. She&#39;s just a young</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.998" end="00:10:34.598" style="s2">girl.</p>
<p begin="00:10:32.798" end="00:10:36.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My sister&#39;s spoiled. Don&#39;t take it to</p>
<p begin="00:10:34.598" end="00:10:38.098" style="s2">heart.</p>
<p begin="00:10:36.198" end="00:10:40.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t. It&#39;s nice to have someone</p>
<p begin="00:10:38.098" end="00:10:40.798" style="s2">looking out for you.</p>
<p begin="00:11:01.898" end="00:11:05.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You embarrassed your big sister Jue Xia</p>
<p begin="00:11:03.398" end="00:11:05.898" style="s2">in front of all those people.</p>
<p begin="00:11:05.098" end="00:11:07.198" style="s2">How is that okay?</p>
<p begin="00:11:05.898" end="00:11:08.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was just making sure she was right for</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.198" end="00:11:10.198" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:11:08.298" end="00:11:13.798" style="s2">City girls can be tricky.</p>
<p begin="00:11:10.198" end="00:11:13.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your big sister Jue Xia isn&#39;t like that.</p>
<p begin="00:11:15.698" end="00:11:19.498" style="s2">It&#39;s a small place. I hope you don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:11:17.198" end="00:11:19.498" style="s2">mind.</p>
<p begin="00:11:19.898" end="00:11:22.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s very clean.</p>
<p begin="00:11:31.898" end="00:11:35.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not good at much, but I can do the</p>
<p begin="00:11:33.498" end="00:11:37.398" style="s2">math. I make 300 a day, and after</p>
<p begin="00:11:35.898" end="00:11:39.698" style="s2">expenses, I can save a little over the</p>
<p begin="00:11:37.398" end="00:11:41.098" style="s2">year. Xiao Yu gets good grades. I can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.698" end="00:11:42.298" style="s2">let money keep her from going to school.</p>
<p begin="00:11:41.098" end="00:11:44.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about you?</p>
<p begin="00:11:42.298" end="00:11:45.898" style="s2">Which column do you put yourself in?</p>
<p begin="00:11:44.398" end="00:11:48.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I I&#39;m fine as long as I have something</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.898" end="00:11:51.098" style="s2">warm to eat.</p>
<p begin="00:11:48.298" end="00:11:52.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He divided up what little he had</p>
<p begin="00:11:51.098" end="00:11:53.998" style="s2">and didn&#39;t save a thing for himself.</p>
<p begin="00:11:52.898" end="00:11:55.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; About today,</p>
<p begin="00:11:53.998" end="00:11:56.898" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry you had to see that. Our place</p>
<p begin="00:11:55.698" end="00:11:58.898" style="s2">is pretty humble.</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.898" end="00:11:59.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xu Xiao Yang, the small place is no big</p>
<p begin="00:11:58.898" end="00:12:01.298" style="s2">deal.</p>
<p begin="00:11:59.798" end="00:12:03.598" style="s2">This is the cleanest home I&#39;ve ever</p>
<p begin="00:12:01.298" end="00:12:03.598" style="s2">seen.</p>
<p begin="00:12:08.298" end="00:12:11.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Set up a scholarship at Xu Qi Zhong in</p>
<p begin="00:12:10.498" end="00:12:13.499" style="s2">the name of the group&#39;s charity</p>
<p begin="00:12:11.698" end="00:12:14.699" style="s2">foundation</p>
<p begin="00:12:13.499" end="00:12:17.399" style="s2">for high-achieving students in their</p>
<p begin="00:12:14.699" end="00:12:21.299" style="s2">senior year who need financial support.</p>
<p begin="00:12:17.399" end="00:12:21.299" style="s2">Make sure Xu Xiao Yu is on the list.</p>
<p begin="00:12:21.999" end="00:12:27.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Shen, doing a good deed anonymously?</p>
<p begin="00:12:24.899" end="00:12:27.899" style="s2">That&#39;s not like you.</p>
<p begin="00:12:29.099" end="00:12:32.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then make it look the part.</p>
<p begin="00:12:30.899" end="00:12:34.699" style="s2">Don&#39;t let anyone trace it back to me.</p>
<p begin="00:12:32.899" end="00:12:36.799" style="s2">Use the foundation standard process with</p>
<p begin="00:12:34.699" end="00:12:38.399" style="s2">a committee review and all.</p>
<p begin="00:12:36.799" end="00:12:40.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Understood.</p>
<p begin="00:12:38.399" end="00:12:42.299" style="s2">By the way, Mr. Shen, Vice President Gu</p>
<p begin="00:12:40.499" end="00:12:44.799" style="s2">recently asked finance for your company</p>
<p begin="00:12:42.299" end="00:12:47.399" style="s2">car records. You should</p>
<p begin="00:12:44.799" end="00:12:47.399" style="s2">be careful.</p>
<p begin="00:12:47.699" end="00:12:50.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let him look.</p>
<p begin="00:12:48.899" end="00:12:52.099" style="s2">Go over the Yun Qi Bei due diligence</p>
<p begin="00:12:50.499" end="00:12:52.999" style="s2">materials again.</p>
<p begin="00:12:52.099" end="00:12:55.299" style="s2">We&#39;ll need them for Friday&#39;s board</p>
<p begin="00:12:52.999" end="00:12:55.299" style="s2">meeting.</p>
<p begin="00:12:58.899" end="00:13:03.999" style="s2">Heng Sheng Group Charity Foundation</p>
<p begin="00:13:00.999" end="00:13:03.999" style="s2">Targeted Scholarship</p>
<p begin="00:13:04.199" end="00:13:07.899" style="s2">Xu Xiao Yu meets the requirements.</p>
<p begin="00:13:06.299" end="00:13:08.899" style="s2">Tuition and room and board are covered</p>
<p begin="00:13:07.899" end="00:13:12.299" style="s2">through college graduation.</p>
<p begin="00:13:08.899" end="00:13:12.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you. Thank you, Heng Sheng.</p>
<p begin="00:13:13.199" end="00:13:16.599" style="s2">Xu Xiao Yu is a wonderful student. She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:13:15.299" end="00:13:17.999" style="s2">earned this.</p>
<p begin="00:13:16.599" end="00:13:19.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The scholarship was transferred to Xu Zi</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.999" end="00:13:21.799" style="s2">Zhong this afternoon through the</p>
<p begin="00:13:19.399" end="00:13:24.799" style="s2">foundation usual process. There&#39;s no way</p>
<p begin="00:13:21.799" end="00:13:24.799" style="s2">to trace it back to you.</p>
<p begin="00:13:29.699" end="00:13:33.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep it discreet, especially around Xu</p>
<p begin="00:13:31.299" end="00:13:35.499" style="s2">Xiao Yang. If he finds out I&#39;m behind</p>
<p begin="00:13:33.099" end="00:13:37.899" style="s2">the money, he probably won&#39;t accept it.</p>
<p begin="00:13:35.499" end="00:13:37.899" style="s2">Understood.</p>
<p begin="00:13:38.499" end="00:13:43.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Shu, is this your girlfriend? Oh,</p>
<p begin="00:13:41.199" end="00:13:45.899" style="s2">what a lovely girl.</p>
<p begin="00:13:43.999" end="00:13:48.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saw her helping you take money last</p>
<p begin="00:13:45.899" end="00:13:50.299" style="s2">time, too. Looks like you&#39;ll be family</p>
<p begin="00:13:48.099" end="00:13:52.099" style="s2">soon.</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.299" end="00:13:53.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aunts, don&#39;t get ahead of yourselves.</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.099" end="00:13:55.999" style="s2">She just came to lend a hand.</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.799" end="00:13:59.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aunts, we&#39;re closing early today. Xu</p>
<p begin="00:13:55.999" end="00:13:59.999" style="s2">Xiao Yang can treat us. You got it.</p>
<p begin="00:14:03.399" end="00:14:06.699" style="s2">Here you go, auntie. Take care.</p>
<p begin="00:14:07.899" end="00:14:14.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s quick on her feet and easy going.</p>
<p begin="00:14:11.399" end="00:14:16.901" style="s2">She&#39;s just right for our Xiao Shu.</p>
<p begin="00:14:14.499" end="00:14:20.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; People on this street may not have much,</p>
<p begin="00:14:16.901" end="00:14:20.301" style="s2">but they&#39;ve got warm hearts.</p>
<p begin="00:14:28.501" end="00:14:34.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s nice. She&#39;s got character.</p>
<p begin="00:14:32.501" end="00:14:36.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you laughing at? The restaurant</p>
<p begin="00:14:34.101" end="00:14:40.001" style="s2">has a serving food, not making buns.</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.501" end="00:14:40.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll keep this one for myself.</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.001" end="00:14:49.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just a sec. The boss sent me to pick you</p>
<p begin="00:14:47.701" end="00:14:51.001" style="s2">up. Something urgent came up at the</p>
<p begin="00:14:49.401" end="00:14:52.501" style="s2">restaurant.</p>
<p begin="00:14:51.001" end="00:14:56.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The restaurant owner&#39;s car is giving me</p>
<p begin="00:14:52.501" end="00:14:56.101" style="s2">a ride back. Go on ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:14:59.701" end="00:15:02.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your boss is thoughtful. He even sent a</p>
<p begin="00:15:01.301" end="00:15:03.401" style="s2">car for an employee when something</p>
<p begin="00:15:02.501" end="00:15:05.901" style="s2">urgent came up.</p>
<p begin="00:15:03.401" end="00:15:07.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He is a good person.</p>
<p begin="00:15:05.901" end="00:15:10.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Buckle up. Text me when you get home</p>
<p begin="00:15:07.701" end="00:15:10.301" style="s2">after you&#39;re done.</p>
<p begin="00:15:11.901" end="00:15:16.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Shen, I almost gave us away. Could</p>
<p begin="00:15:14.201" end="00:15:18.101" style="s2">we get a more beat-up car next time?</p>
<p begin="00:15:16.901" end="00:15:20.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does the group even have any beat-up</p>
<p begin="00:15:18.101" end="00:15:21.801" style="s2">cars?</p>
<p begin="00:15:20.001" end="00:15:24.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The logistics department&#39;s Jinbei van,</p>
<p begin="00:15:21.801" end="00:15:26.701" style="s2">the one they use to haul produce.</p>
<p begin="00:15:24.301" end="00:15:28.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Starting tomorrow, we&#39;ll use that one.</p>
<p begin="00:15:26.701" end="00:15:30.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve marked the points the board members</p>
<p begin="00:15:28.301" end="00:15:34.601" style="s2">are likely to challenge you on</p>
<p begin="00:15:30.401" end="00:15:34.601" style="s2">in the Yunzhibei due diligence report.</p>
<p begin="00:15:42.301" end="00:15:45.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss, that van haul&#39;s produce, it&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:15:44.301" end="00:15:47.601" style="s2">reek of vegetables.</p>
<p begin="00:15:45.401" end="00:15:50.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That fresh produce smell is great. Keeps</p>
<p begin="00:15:47.601" end="00:15:50.501" style="s2">things down to earth.</p>
<p begin="00:15:55.601" end="00:15:59.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eat up, Shu. You have to get up early</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.701" end="00:16:01.101" style="s2">tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:15:59.501" end="00:16:03.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You eat too, auntie. I skimmed the fat</p>
<p begin="00:16:01.101" end="00:16:03.701" style="s2">off the soup.</p>
<p begin="00:16:10.101" end="00:16:13.401" style="s2">It&#39;s so late. You&#39;re still working?</p>
<p begin="00:16:13.601" end="00:16:18.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s the restaurant staff group. They</p>
<p begin="00:16:15.301" end="00:16:18.601" style="s2">tag everyone non-stop.</p>
<p begin="00:16:19.301" end="00:16:23.302" style="s2">I&#39;ll leave it later.</p>
<p begin="00:16:21.602" end="00:16:25.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your boss is something else. Can&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="00:16:23.302" end="00:16:27.802" style="s2">let you relax after work. Don&#39;t wear</p>
<p begin="00:16:25.302" end="00:16:27.802" style="s2">yourself out.</p>
<p begin="00:16:28.702" end="00:16:31.702" style="s2">It&#39;s supposed to get colder in a couple</p>
<p begin="00:16:29.902" end="00:16:34.602" style="s2">of days. You</p>
<p begin="00:16:31.702" end="00:16:36.202" style="s2">Never mind. I&#39;ll tell you then.</p>
<p begin="00:16:34.602" end="00:16:36.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re leaving me hanging? That&#39;s not</p>
<p begin="00:16:36.202" end="00:16:39.302" style="s2">like you.</p>
<p begin="00:16:36.602" end="00:16:39.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a secret.</p>
<p begin="00:16:42.602" end="00:16:46.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The kinder he is to me, the guiltier I</p>
<p begin="00:16:44.802" end="00:16:50.202" style="s2">feel.</p>
<p begin="00:16:46.702" end="00:16:50.202" style="s2">Could you pull over, please?</p>
<p begin="00:16:54.502" end="00:16:57.202" style="s2">Days like these I wish they could last a</p>
<p begin="00:16:55.702" end="00:16:59.502" style="s2">little longer.</p>
<p begin="00:16:57.202" end="00:17:00.802" style="s2">A lot longer.</p>
<p begin="00:16:59.502" end="00:17:02.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am,</p>
<p begin="00:17:00.802" end="00:17:03.302" style="s2">when you&#39;re stuck in bed, food can sit</p>
<p begin="00:17:02.502" end="00:17:04.802" style="s2">heavy.</p>
<p begin="00:17:03.302" end="00:17:06.502" style="s2">I looked up the recipe and made some yam</p>
<p begin="00:17:04.802" end="00:17:09.202" style="s2">and red bean cakes. They&#39;re soft and</p>
<p begin="00:17:06.502" end="00:17:09.202" style="s2">easy to digest.</p>
<p begin="00:17:12.702" end="00:17:18.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is delicious. Zhao Zewu, you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:17:15.302" end="00:17:18.702" style="s2">good enough to run a restaurant.</p>
<p begin="00:17:20.202" end="00:17:23.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, it&#39;s sunny today. Let me take you</p>
<p begin="00:17:22.002" end="00:17:26.102" style="s2">outside for some fresh air. Lying in bed</p>
<p begin="00:17:23.802" end="00:17:28.602" style="s2">all the time makes you stiff.</p>
<p begin="00:17:26.102" end="00:17:28.602" style="s2">Give me a hand.</p>
<p begin="00:17:29.502" end="00:17:32.802" style="s2">Ma&#39;am, my grandma lives back in the</p>
<p begin="00:17:30.902" end="00:17:34.202" style="s2">country too. Her back and legs aren&#39;t in</p>
<p begin="00:17:32.802" end="00:17:35.802" style="s2">great shape, so I visit her once a</p>
<p begin="00:17:34.202" end="00:17:37.502" style="s2">month. She&#39;s always hoping I&#39;ll bring</p>
<p begin="00:17:35.802" end="00:17:40.402" style="s2">home a wife for her to meet. I tell her</p>
<p begin="00:17:37.502" end="00:17:43.002" style="s2">soon, soon. Truth is, there&#39;s not even a</p>
<p begin="00:17:40.402" end="00:17:43.002" style="s2">hint of it yet.</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.902" end="00:17:54.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Guodong,</p>
<p begin="00:17:52.602" end="00:17:56.902" style="s2">I really can&#39;t bear to keep deceiving</p>
<p begin="00:17:54.302" end="00:17:56.902" style="s2">this boy.</p>
<p begin="00:18:02.702" end="00:18:07.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chutao Yang, what if you found out I&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:18:04.802" end="00:18:07.602" style="s2">lied to you someday?</p>
<p begin="00:18:09.202" end="00:18:12.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you lied to me,</p>
<p begin="00:18:10.602" end="00:18:13.302" style="s2">what would you want from me?</p>
<p begin="00:18:12.102" end="00:18:16.602" style="s2">My tricycle?</p>
<p begin="00:18:13.302" end="00:18:19.702" style="s2">Or all that flour in my place?</p>
<p begin="00:18:16.602" end="00:18:19.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I mean, hypothetically.</p>
<p begin="00:18:20.202" end="00:18:24.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can lie to me. I have only one</p>
<p begin="00:18:22.103" end="00:18:25.903" style="s2">condition.</p>
<p begin="00:18:24.203" end="00:18:27.503" style="s2">Don&#39;t lie to my grandma. She couldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:18:25.903" end="00:18:29.603" style="s2">take it.</p>
<p begin="00:18:27.503" end="00:18:30.703" style="s2">I&#39;m tough. If you lie to me, I can</p>
<p begin="00:18:29.603" end="00:18:32.103" style="s2">handle it.</p>
<p begin="00:18:30.703" end="00:18:33.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chu Chu Young,</p>
<p begin="00:18:32.103" end="00:18:36.903" style="s2">how can I keep lying to you after you</p>
<p begin="00:18:33.703" end="00:18:36.903" style="s2">say something like that?</p>
<p begin="00:18:39.403" end="00:18:42.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eat the center. It&#39;s sweet.</p>
<p begin="00:18:44.103" end="00:18:48.003" style="s2">Hey, it&#39;s hot. Let me blow on it for</p>
<p begin="00:18:46.003" end="00:18:51.803" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:18:48.003" end="00:18:51.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s windy. Got something in my eye.</p>
<p begin="00:18:54.803" end="00:18:58.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eat it on the way. Keep your hands warm.</p>
<p begin="00:19:10.603" end="00:19:13.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Buying one for your girlfriend, sir?</p>
<p begin="00:19:12.203" end="00:19:15.303" style="s2">This one&#39;s our best seller.</p>
<p begin="00:19:13.703" end="00:19:17.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her hands get cold in winter, and she</p>
<p begin="00:19:15.303" end="00:19:20.003" style="s2">gets cold around the neck, too.</p>
<p begin="00:19:17.103" end="00:19:20.003" style="s2">Is this scarf itchy?</p>
<p begin="00:19:23.203" end="00:19:26.403" style="s2">I&#39;ll take it. Could you use the paper</p>
<p begin="00:19:25.003" end="00:19:27.703" style="s2">with the subtle pattern? She likes</p>
<p begin="00:19:26.403" end="00:19:29.303" style="s2">simple things.</p>
<p begin="00:19:27.703" end="00:19:31.503" style="s2">It&#39;s getting colder. Your hands are</p>
<p begin="00:19:29.303" end="00:19:34.703" style="s2">always cold. I see you tucking them into</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.503" end="00:19:34.703" style="s2">your sleeves when you pack up.</p>
<p begin="00:19:36.903" end="00:19:41.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You won&#39;t even buy yourself a new coat.</p>
<p begin="00:19:39.703" end="00:19:44.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mine&#39;s still fine, but I can&#39;t let your</p>
<p begin="00:19:41.603" end="00:19:44.303" style="s2">neck get cold.</p>
<p begin="00:19:45.503" end="00:19:50.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shen Zhi Xia, you can&#39;t keep this act up</p>
<p begin="00:19:47.303" end="00:19:52.303" style="s2">much longer. This charade, it&#39;s time to</p>
<p begin="00:19:50.203" end="00:19:54.303" style="s2">end it.</p>
<p begin="00:19:52.303" end="00:19:56.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But I can&#39;t bear to.</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.303" end="00:19:58.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shen Zhi Xia,</p>
<p begin="00:19:56.203" end="00:19:59.903" style="s2">the longer you keep lying, the more</p>
<p begin="00:19:58.303" end="00:20:03.403" style="s2">you&#39;ll hurt him.</p>
<p begin="00:19:59.903" end="00:20:03.403" style="s2">Find a chance to tell him.</p>
<p begin="00:20:06.203" end="00:20:09.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhi Xia, I&#39;ve been looking everywhere</p>
<p begin="00:20:07.803" end="00:20:11.203" style="s2">for you. What are you doing in a place</p>
<p begin="00:20:09.503" end="00:20:12.403" style="s2">like this?</p>
<p begin="00:20:11.203" end="00:20:13.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Du Cheng Ze,</p>
<p begin="00:20:12.403" end="00:20:15.003" style="s2">what are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:20:13.703" end="00:20:16.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your mother&#39;s not well, so I found the</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.003" end="00:20:18.703" style="s2">best rehab center for her. The car&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:20:16.703" end="00:20:20.103" style="s2">right outside. Come with me.</p>
<p begin="00:20:18.703" end="00:20:21.103" style="s2">Stay in a place like this too long and</p>
<p begin="00:20:20.103" end="00:20:23.405" style="s2">it&#39;ll bring you down.</p>
<p begin="00:20:21.103" end="00:20:25.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, Zhi Xia&#39;s at home. She&#39;s not going</p>
<p begin="00:20:23.405" end="00:20:25.905" style="s2">anywhere.</p>
<p begin="00:20:29.205" end="00:20:32.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And who are you supposed to be? Some</p>
<p begin="00:20:30.705" end="00:20:33.605" style="s2">breakfast vendor? Zhixia, since when did</p>
<p begin="00:20:32.505" end="00:20:35.905" style="s2">you start hanging out with people like</p>
<p begin="00:20:33.605" end="00:20:35.905" style="s2">him?</p>
<p begin="00:20:37.005" end="00:20:42.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gu Chengze, this is my family&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:20:39.005" end="00:20:42.505" style="s2">business. It&#39;s none of yours.</p>
<p begin="00:20:44.005" end="00:20:48.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Listen, kid. Some women are out of your</p>
<p begin="00:20:46.305" end="00:20:51.605" style="s2">league. The kind of life she lives, you</p>
<p begin="00:20:48.905" end="00:20:51.605" style="s2">can&#39;t afford.</p>
<p begin="00:20:55.805" end="00:20:58.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who was that guy?</p>
<p begin="00:20:57.405" end="00:21:02.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone I used to know.</p>
<p begin="00:20:58.905" end="00:21:02.305" style="s2">Ignore him. He&#39;s crazy.</p>
<p begin="00:21:03.705" end="00:21:08.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, how did Gu Chengze find the repair</p>
<p begin="00:21:06.205" end="00:21:08.605" style="s2">shop?</p>
<p begin="00:21:09.505" end="00:21:15.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Gu and Shen families go way back.</p>
<p begin="00:21:11.905" end="00:21:15.205" style="s2">You two grew up knowing each other.</p>
<p begin="00:21:15.705" end="00:21:19.705" style="s2">He came to ask for your hand.</p>
<p begin="00:21:17.605" end="00:21:23.005" style="s2">I turned him down.</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.705" end="00:21:23.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll decide who I marry.</p>
<p begin="00:21:27.705" end="00:21:30.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gu Chengze, Vice President of Hong Sheng</p>
<p begin="00:21:29.405" end="00:21:32.205" style="s2">Group.</p>
<p begin="00:21:30.605" end="00:21:34.205" style="s2">Hey kid, we need to talk.</p>
<p begin="00:21:32.205" end="00:21:36.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you&#39;re buying buns, get in line. If</p>
<p begin="00:21:34.205" end="00:21:37.005" style="s2">not, move aside. There&#39;s a crowd behind</p>
<p begin="00:21:36.005" end="00:21:38.405" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:21:37.005" end="00:21:39.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leave Shen Zhixia, and if you know</p>
<p begin="00:21:38.405" end="00:21:41.105" style="s2">what&#39;s good for you, I&#39;ll get your stall</p>
<p begin="00:21:39.805" end="00:21:43.705" style="s2">into a food court at the Hong Sheng</p>
<p begin="00:21:41.105" end="00:21:46.005" style="s2">Mall. You won&#39;t pay a penny in rent.</p>
<p begin="00:21:43.705" end="00:21:49.605" style="s2">If you don&#39;t know what&#39;s good for you,</p>
<p begin="00:21:46.005" end="00:21:49.605" style="s2">your stall could be gone by tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.805" end="00:21:56.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This table&#39;s a little wobbly.</p>
<p begin="00:21:55.405" end="00:21:58.905" style="s2">Your business card&#39;s made of pretty nice</p>
<p begin="00:21:56.605" end="00:21:58.905" style="s2">paper.</p>
<p begin="00:22:00.605" end="00:22:04.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gu Chengze, listen up. This is my</p>
<p begin="00:22:02.705" end="00:22:08.505" style="s2">boyfriend. He has every right to be</p>
<p begin="00:22:04.605" end="00:22:08.505" style="s2">involved in my life. You don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:22:09.905" end="00:22:14.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhixia, who is he exactly? Hong Sheng</p>
<p begin="00:22:12.605" end="00:22:15.505" style="s2">Group? That&#39;s the biggest company in our</p>
<p begin="00:22:14.405" end="00:22:17.205" style="s2">city.</p>
<p begin="00:22:15.505" end="00:22:19.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We grew up in the same compound. That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:22:17.205" end="00:22:22.105" style="s2">all in the past. Forget him.</p>
<p begin="00:22:19.405" end="00:22:22.105" style="s2">Let&#39;s sell some buns.</p>
<p begin="00:22:32.106" end="00:22:35.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chi Xiao,</p>
<p begin="00:22:33.506" end="00:22:38.006" style="s2">that Gu Cheng Ze, I don&#39;t think he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:22:35.606" end="00:22:41.606" style="s2">just someone you used to know.</p>
<p begin="00:22:38.006" end="00:22:44.406" style="s2">The way he looks at you, it&#39;s different.</p>
<p begin="00:22:41.606" end="00:22:46.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t control how he looks at me.</p>
<p begin="00:22:44.406" end="00:22:49.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chu Chao Yang, don&#39;t you know who I look</p>
<p begin="00:22:46.806" end="00:22:49.006" style="s2">at?</p>
<p begin="00:22:55.006" end="00:23:00.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, what if someone gets sick from</p>
<p begin="00:22:56.506" end="00:23:00.306" style="s2">eating in these unsanitary conditions?</p>
<p begin="00:23:01.806" end="00:23:07.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re spoiled.</p>
<p begin="00:23:03.706" end="00:23:07.506" style="s2">Boss, these buns are spoiled.</p>
<p begin="00:23:11.906" end="00:23:15.206" style="s2">These buns were made fresh before dawn</p>
<p begin="00:23:13.506" end="00:23:16.406" style="s2">and steamed right in front of everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:23:15.206" end="00:23:19.906" style="s2">If you&#39;re here to cause trouble, take it</p>
<p begin="00:23:16.406" end="00:23:19.906" style="s2">up with me. Don&#39;t scare the customers.</p>
<p begin="00:23:21.606" end="00:23:23.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You.</p>
<p begin="00:23:25.806" end="00:23:29.006" style="s2">We&#39;ve received a report that this place</p>
<p begin="00:23:27.306" end="00:23:31.106" style="s2">is unsanitary and operating without a</p>
<p begin="00:23:29.006" end="00:23:34.306" style="s2">license. Shut it down for rectification</p>
<p begin="00:23:31.106" end="00:23:34.306" style="s2">and cooperate with the inspection.</p>
<p begin="00:23:41.306" end="00:23:44.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, you always said that when you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:23:42.406" end="00:23:47.106" style="s2">preparing food, your hands have to stay</p>
<p begin="00:23:44.206" end="00:23:48.906" style="s2">clean. But in this world,</p>
<p begin="00:23:47.106" end="00:23:52.106" style="s2">even with clean hands, how can people</p>
<p begin="00:23:48.906" end="00:23:52.106" style="s2">still smear your name?</p>
<p begin="00:23:57.106" end="00:24:02.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chu Chao Yang, about this.</p>
<p begin="00:24:00.506" end="00:24:03.306" style="s2">You wreck his stall, report him, and get</p>
<p begin="00:24:02.106" end="00:24:04.906" style="s2">him shut down.</p>
<p begin="00:24:03.306" end="00:24:05.506" style="s2">Gu Cheng Ze, you really out done</p>
<p begin="00:24:04.906" end="00:24:07.506" style="s2">yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:24:05.506" end="00:24:10.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ms. Shen, want me to teach Vice</p>
<p begin="00:24:07.506" end="00:24:12.106" style="s2">President Gu a lesson?</p>
<p begin="00:24:10.106" end="00:24:13.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Handle the important stuff first.</p>
<p begin="00:24:12.106" end="00:24:15.206" style="s2">Food business permit, health</p>
<p begin="00:24:13.406" end="00:24:17.806" style="s2">certificate, stall registration, the</p>
<p begin="00:24:15.206" end="00:24:19.406" style="s2">whole package. Get it done tonight, even</p>
<p begin="00:24:17.806" end="00:24:21.206" style="s2">if you have to work overtime.</p>
<p begin="00:24:19.406" end="00:24:22.806" style="s2">Use the fast track process. I&#39;ll call</p>
<p begin="00:24:21.206" end="00:24:24.406" style="s2">the director myself.</p>
<p begin="00:24:22.806" end="00:24:25.606" style="s2">Wouldn&#39;t that expose you?</p>
<p begin="00:24:24.406" end="00:24:26.806" style="s2">Put it through the neighborhood&#39;s public</p>
<p begin="00:24:25.606" end="00:24:28.506" style="s2">service program.</p>
<p begin="00:24:26.806" end="00:24:30.207" style="s2">Don&#39;t put my name on it.</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.506" end="00:24:32.207" style="s2">He gets up before dawn and works late to</p>
<p begin="00:24:30.207" end="00:24:34.707" style="s2">earn honest money. I won&#39;t be the one to</p>
<p begin="00:24:32.207" end="00:24:34.707" style="s2">sully it.</p>
<p begin="00:24:37.707" end="00:24:40.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chef Chu, your stall is now part of the</p>
<p begin="00:24:39.307" end="00:24:42.007" style="s2">neighborhood&#39;s breakfast program. Your</p>
<p begin="00:24:40.707" end="00:24:43.107" style="s2">permits are all in order and we</p>
<p begin="00:24:42.007" end="00:24:44.807" style="s2">fast-tracked your health certificate,</p>
<p begin="00:24:43.107" end="00:24:48.807" style="s2">too. Keep up the good work.</p>
<p begin="00:24:44.807" end="00:24:50.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since when did things get done so fast?</p>
<p begin="00:24:48.807" end="00:24:52.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe we caught a break with the new</p>
<p begin="00:24:50.107" end="00:24:52.507" style="s2">policy.</p>
<p begin="00:24:57.307" end="00:25:00.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All the permits are in order and he&#39;s in</p>
<p begin="00:24:58.807" end="00:25:03.107" style="s2">the public service program. Who arranged</p>
<p begin="00:25:00.707" end="00:25:03.107" style="s2">this?</p>
<p begin="00:25:06.107" end="00:25:09.408" style="s2">For some breakfast stall owner?</p>
<p begin="00:25:19.307" end="00:25:22.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xu Chao Yang.</p>
<p begin="00:25:23.408" end="00:25:27.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:25:24.107" end="00:25:27.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough talking. Push the cart.</p>
<p begin="00:25:38.207" end="00:25:41.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you trying to be a hero in this</p>
<p begin="00:25:39.807" end="00:25:44.408" style="s2">downpour?</p>
<p begin="00:25:41.607" end="00:25:44.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I want to.</p>
<p begin="00:25:46.107" end="00:25:49.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Driver, why Xu Street?</p>
<p begin="00:25:54.307" end="00:25:56.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Idiot.</p>
<p begin="00:26:02.908" end="00:26:08.908" style="s2">Pack up. We&#39;re going to the hospital.</p>
<p begin="00:26:06.007" end="00:26:12.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pack up what? The customers are waiting.</p>
<p begin="00:26:08.908" end="00:26:14.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll be fine. I can tough it out.</p>
<p begin="00:26:12.207" end="00:26:16.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone, the owner is sick today. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:26:14.707" end="00:26:18.007" style="s2">sell the rest of the buns, then we&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:26:16.408" end="00:26:21.607" style="s2">close up so you can rest.</p>
<p begin="00:26:18.007" end="00:26:21.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The boss&#39;s wife has spoken.</p>
<p begin="00:26:27.707" end="00:26:32.009" style="s2">You&#39;ve got a fever of 101.3</p>
<p begin="00:26:30.307" end="00:26:32.909" style="s2">and you&#39;re still out here working? Are</p>
<p begin="00:26:32.009" end="00:26:34.409" style="s2">you made of iron?</p>
<p begin="00:26:32.909" end="00:26:36.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The customers are waiting.</p>
<p begin="00:26:34.409" end="00:26:39.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s more important, the customers or</p>
<p begin="00:26:36.609" end="00:26:39.309" style="s2">your life?</p>
<p begin="00:26:51.709" end="00:26:55.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, is this being put up for me?</p>
<p begin="00:26:53.809" end="00:26:58.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a neighborhood improvement project.</p>
<p begin="00:26:55.509" end="00:26:58.709" style="s2">This is the only stretch they&#39;re doing.</p>
<p begin="00:27:00.209" end="00:27:04.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shijia, first the ride, now this kiosk.</p>
<p begin="00:27:03.509" end="00:27:07.309" style="s2">Don&#39;t tell me this has something to do</p>
<p begin="00:27:04.909" end="00:27:09.209" style="s2">with your restaurant boss too.</p>
<p begin="00:27:07.309" end="00:27:11.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re overthinking it. Didn&#39;t you hear</p>
<p begin="00:27:09.209" end="00:27:11.709" style="s2">what he said?</p>
<p begin="00:27:14.109" end="00:27:18.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shijia, be honest with me.</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.709" end="00:27:20.809" style="s2">What does Hong Sheng Group have to do</p>
<p begin="00:27:18.309" end="00:27:20.809" style="s2">with you?</p>
<p begin="00:27:21.409" end="00:27:26.109" style="s2">There were 37 scholarships for the whole</p>
<p begin="00:27:23.109" end="00:27:27.809" style="s2">school and I was the first one picked.</p>
<p begin="00:27:26.109" end="00:27:29.809" style="s2">I asked the finance teacher.</p>
<p begin="00:27:27.809" end="00:27:32.709" style="s2">The transfer memo had my name on it.</p>
<p begin="00:27:29.809" end="00:27:32.709" style="s2">Don&#39;t think I&#39;m an idiot.</p>
<p begin="00:27:33.909" end="00:27:38.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiaoyu, the money, I do have some</p>
<p begin="00:27:36.509" end="00:27:40.409" style="s2">connection to it.</p>
<p begin="00:27:38.609" end="00:27:41.809" style="s2">All I can tell you is it was easier for</p>
<p begin="00:27:40.409" end="00:27:42.809" style="s2">me to come by money than it was for your</p>
<p begin="00:27:41.809" end="00:27:44.409" style="s2">brother.</p>
<p begin="00:27:42.809" end="00:27:46.509" style="s2">But my feelings for him are real.</p>
<p begin="00:27:44.409" end="00:27:47.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you, really?</p>
<p begin="00:27:46.509" end="00:27:49.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m someone who truly wants to build a</p>
<p begin="00:27:47.909" end="00:27:52.209" style="s2">life with your brother.</p>
<p begin="00:27:49.509" end="00:27:56.309" style="s2">Please, don&#39;t tell him.</p>
<p begin="00:27:52.209" end="00:27:56.309" style="s2">Some things I need to tell him myself.</p>
<p begin="00:28:00.309" end="00:28:02.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m keeping an eye on you for my</p>
<p begin="00:28:01.209" end="00:28:04.309" style="s2">brother.</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.509" end="00:28:06.609" style="s2">If you dare to lie to him, you&#39;ll answer</p>
<p begin="00:28:04.309" end="00:28:06.609" style="s2">to me.</p>
<p begin="00:28:11.609" end="00:28:14.309" style="s2">My brother spent all afternoon picking</p>
<p begin="00:28:13.009" end="00:28:15.609" style="s2">out that scarf.</p>
<p begin="00:28:14.309" end="00:28:18.709" style="s2">You better not throw it away or you&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:28:15.609" end="00:28:18.709" style="s2">have me to deal with</p>
<p begin="00:28:28.009" end="00:28:34.209" style="s2">Shijia,</p>
<p begin="00:28:30.409" end="00:28:34.209" style="s2">what kind of person are you, really?</p>
<p begin="00:28:40.610" end="00:28:45.210" style="s2">The report has to be ready by 8 tomorrow</p>
<p begin="00:28:42.810" end="00:28:45.210" style="s2">morning.</p>
<p begin="00:28:46.110" end="00:28:49.310" style="s2">I&#39;ll handle the shareholders.</p>
<p begin="00:28:47.910" end="00:28:52.810" style="s2">Anyone who tries to mess with the Unity</p>
<p begin="00:28:49.310" end="00:28:52.810" style="s2">Bay project can come straight to me.</p>
<p begin="00:28:57.710" end="00:29:01.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shareholders, projects,</p>
<p begin="00:29:00.210" end="00:29:03.510" style="s2">reports,</p>
<p begin="00:29:01.510" end="00:29:04.510" style="s2">a restaurant waitress.</p>
<p begin="00:29:03.510" end="00:29:06.910" style="s2">Why does she talk like she&#39;s in a</p>
<p begin="00:29:04.510" end="00:29:06.910" style="s2">boardroom?</p>
<p begin="00:29:10.910" end="00:29:14.610" style="s2">Maybe I&#39;m reading too much into it,</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.910" end="00:29:17.510" style="s2">but I know this street like the back of</p>
<p begin="00:29:14.610" end="00:29:21.210" style="s2">my hand. The way she was just now, I</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.510" end="00:29:21.210" style="s2">didn&#39;t recognize her at all.</p>
<p begin="00:29:31.610" end="00:29:36.710" style="s2">Shall you tell me this?</p>
<p begin="00:29:34.110" end="00:29:40.310" style="s2">How does a restaurant server</p>
<p begin="00:29:36.710" end="00:29:42.110" style="s2">know terms like shareholder reports?</p>
<p begin="00:29:40.310" end="00:29:43.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bro, just because someone&#39;s a server</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.110" end="00:29:46.410" style="s2">doesn&#39;t mean they can&#39;t understand</p>
<p begin="00:29:43.110" end="00:29:47.810" style="s2">reports. It&#39;s all over TV these days.</p>
<p begin="00:29:46.410" end="00:29:49.410" style="s2">You&#39;re too trusting.</p>
<p begin="00:29:47.810" end="00:29:51.010" style="s2">Quit being so suspicious all the time or</p>
<p begin="00:29:49.410" end="00:29:54.010" style="s2">you&#39;ll scare her off.</p>
<p begin="00:29:51.010" end="00:29:57.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But the way she acted that day,</p>
<p begin="00:29:54.010" end="00:29:57.010" style="s2">it didn&#39;t seem fake.</p>
<p begin="00:30:00.710" end="00:30:03.810" style="s2">Bro,</p>
<p begin="00:30:02.210" end="00:30:05.510" style="s2">I only know one thing.</p>
<p begin="00:30:03.810" end="00:30:07.710" style="s2">The day you had a fever, she stood by</p>
<p begin="00:30:05.510" end="00:30:10.210" style="s2">our stall all day and didn&#39;t even stop</p>
<p begin="00:30:07.710" end="00:30:10.210" style="s2">for a drink.</p>
<p begin="00:30:11.110" end="00:30:15.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t fake the way she looks at you.</p>
<p begin="00:30:17.910" end="00:30:21.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhusha&#39;s not that kind of person. What</p>
<p begin="00:30:19.710" end="00:30:23.310" style="s2">would she get out of lying to me?</p>
<p begin="00:30:21.310" end="00:30:24.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey Shu, where&#39;d you go? Lost in</p>
<p begin="00:30:23.310" end="00:30:25.110" style="s2">thought?</p>
<p begin="00:30:24.410" end="00:30:28.110" style="s2">Missing your girl?</p>
<p begin="00:30:25.110" end="00:30:28.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t tease me, auntie.</p>
<p begin="00:30:39.412" end="00:30:42.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Move forward with this plan.</p>
<p begin="00:30:51.812" end="00:30:57.112" style="s2">Was that really Ji Sha?</p>
<p begin="00:30:53.712" end="00:30:57.112" style="s2">Or did I never know her at all?</p>
<p begin="00:31:10.712" end="00:31:17.612" style="s2">Xu Chao Yang. Xu Chao Yang.</p>
<p begin="00:31:14.412" end="00:31:17.612" style="s2">Do you really know who she is?</p>
<p begin="00:31:19.712" end="00:31:23.812" style="s2">Keep it. Next time, take her with you.</p>
<p begin="00:31:32.412" end="00:31:35.612" style="s2">I booked a table for two.</p>
<p begin="00:31:43.112" end="00:31:46.612" style="s2">Sir, we close at 10.</p>
<p begin="00:31:53.512" end="00:31:56.912" style="s2">Thanks. Keep the change.</p>
<p begin="00:32:15.712" end="00:32:21.112" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry</p>
<p begin="00:32:17.412" end="00:32:21.112" style="s2">for keeping you waiting all night.</p>
<p begin="00:32:26.912" end="00:32:31.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry. I couldn&#39;t get away last</p>
<p begin="00:32:29.312" end="00:32:33.612" style="s2">night.</p>
<p begin="00:32:31.312" end="00:32:36.612" style="s2">I made this to make it up to you. I know</p>
<p begin="00:32:33.612" end="00:32:36.612" style="s2">it tastes awful.</p>
<p begin="00:32:43.813" end="00:32:47.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop eating.</p>
<p begin="00:32:45.113" end="00:32:51.213" style="s2">It&#39;s really awful.</p>
<p begin="00:32:47.313" end="00:32:51.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You made this? Then it can&#39;t be bad.</p>
<p begin="00:32:55.113" end="00:32:59.913" style="s2">I have nothing to my name, just a food</p>
<p begin="00:32:56.813" end="00:33:04.313" style="s2">stall. I can&#39;t give you a good life.</p>
<p begin="00:32:59.913" end="00:33:04.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xu Zhaoyang, I want you for you.</p>
<p begin="00:33:10.813" end="00:33:16.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s take this relationship</p>
<p begin="00:33:12.313" end="00:33:17.013" style="s2">seriously. I&#39;ll cook and you can eat.</p>
<p begin="00:33:16.113" end="00:33:19.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:33:17.013" end="00:33:19.713" style="s2">It&#39;s a promise.</p>
<p begin="00:33:26.513" end="00:33:32.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then from now on, we&#39;ll do it this way.</p>
<p begin="00:33:29.613" end="00:33:32.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s how we&#39;ll do it.</p>
<p begin="00:33:43.713" end="00:33:47.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tan Yue, make the arrangements. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:33:45.613" end="00:33:49.613" style="s2">going to tell Xu Zhaoyang who I really</p>
<p begin="00:33:47.313" end="00:33:49.613" style="s2">am.</p>
<p begin="00:33:51.713" end="00:33:54.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Xu,</p>
<p begin="00:33:52.913" end="00:33:55.713" style="s2">I called you here because there&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:33:54.213" end="00:33:57.213" style="s2">something I can&#39;t keep from you any</p>
<p begin="00:33:55.713" end="00:33:59.713" style="s2">longer.</p>
<p begin="00:33:57.213" end="00:33:59.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go ahead, uncle.</p>
<p begin="00:33:59.913" end="00:34:04.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our family,</p>
<p begin="00:34:01.713" end="00:34:06.313" style="s2">we owe 200,000 yuan.</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.913" end="00:34:08.213" style="s2">We borrowed it years ago for Xu</p>
<p begin="00:34:06.313" end="00:34:10.213" style="s2">Zhaoyang&#39;s mom&#39;s medical bills.</p>
<p begin="00:34:08.213" end="00:34:11.713" style="s2">With interest piling up, it&#39;s grown to</p>
<p begin="00:34:10.213" end="00:34:13.913" style="s2">this much.</p>
<p begin="00:34:11.713" end="00:34:15.513" style="s2">If you really want to marry Xu Zhaoyang,</p>
<p begin="00:34:13.913" end="00:34:16.713" style="s2">you&#39;ll have to help her pay off this</p>
<p begin="00:34:15.513" end="00:34:18.013" style="s2">debt.</p>
<p begin="00:34:16.713" end="00:34:20.113" style="s2">If you think it over and decide you</p>
<p begin="00:34:18.013" end="00:34:24.013" style="s2">can&#39;t do it, I won&#39;t hold it against</p>
<p begin="00:34:20.113" end="00:34:24.013" style="s2">you. You can still back out now.</p>
<p begin="00:34:31.713" end="00:34:35.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncle, this is everything I&#39;ve saved,</p>
<p begin="00:34:33.613" end="00:34:37.213" style="s2">30,000 yuan. Please use it to pay some</p>
<p begin="00:34:35.813" end="00:34:39.413" style="s2">of the debt.</p>
<p begin="00:34:37.213" end="00:34:40.813" style="s2">The remaining 170,000 yuan, I&#39;ll steam a</p>
<p begin="00:34:39.413" end="00:34:42.414" style="s2">couple more baskets in the morning and</p>
<p begin="00:34:40.813" end="00:34:45.314" style="s2">set up a stall at the night market. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:34:42.414" end="00:34:45.314" style="s2">pay it off bit by bit.</p>
<p begin="00:34:46.914" end="00:34:52.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. As long as I have food to</p>
<p begin="00:34:48.514" end="00:34:52.514" style="s2">eat, Zhixuan and Auntie won&#39;t go hungry.</p>
<p begin="00:34:54.114" end="00:34:57.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sun, how long did it take you to save</p>
<p begin="00:34:56.214" end="00:34:58.514" style="s2">this money?</p>
<p begin="00:34:57.214" end="00:35:00.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not long, uncle. I can earn the money</p>
<p begin="00:34:58.514" end="00:35:03.414" style="s2">back, but if I let her go, I&#39;ll lose her</p>
<p begin="00:35:00.914" end="00:35:03.414" style="s2">for good.</p>
<p begin="00:35:14.514" end="00:35:19.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dear, we accept him as our son-in-law.</p>
<p begin="00:35:18.214" end="00:35:23.214" style="s2">It&#39;s just that our daughter doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:35:19.714" end="00:35:23.214" style="s2">deserve a heart this good.</p>
<p begin="00:35:28.314" end="00:35:31.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is the registration form to use the</p>
<p begin="00:35:29.514" end="00:35:34.414" style="s2">community kiosk, right? Get it stamped</p>
<p begin="00:35:31.214" end="00:35:34.414" style="s2">on the third floor, then come back.</p>
<p begin="00:36:04.014" end="00:36:07.114" style="s2">Miss Shen, this is the letter of intent</p>
<p begin="00:36:05.614" end="00:36:09.614" style="s2">for the Yunchi Bay partnership. Please</p>
<p begin="00:36:07.114" end="00:36:09.614" style="s2">take a look.</p>
<p begin="00:36:32.514" end="00:36:37.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Shen, still Zhixuan?</p>
<p begin="00:36:35.414" end="00:36:39.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shutong, let me explain.</p>
<p begin="00:36:37.114" end="00:36:40.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Explain what?</p>
<p begin="00:36:39.614" end="00:36:41.614" style="s2">That you&#39;re the president of Hong Shen</p>
<p begin="00:36:40.714" end="00:36:43.016" style="s2">Group?</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.614" end="00:36:44.216" style="s2">That these past six months of living in</p>
<p begin="00:36:43.016" end="00:36:47.316" style="s2">poverty</p>
<p begin="00:36:44.216" end="00:36:49.116" style="s2">were all part of your plan?</p>
<p begin="00:36:47.316" end="00:36:51.616" style="s2">That your family of three watched me</p>
<p begin="00:36:49.116" end="00:36:55.516" style="s2">like a monkey in your own repair shop,</p>
<p begin="00:36:51.616" end="00:36:55.516" style="s2">testing me and giving me scores?</p>
<p begin="00:37:01.016" end="00:37:06.116" style="s2">I was even thinking I&#39;d save up enough</p>
<p begin="00:37:02.716" end="00:37:07.816" style="s2">money and give you a proper wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:37:06.116" end="00:37:10.016" style="s2">But it turns out</p>
<p begin="00:37:07.816" end="00:37:13.216" style="s2">a single floor tile in your house is</p>
<p begin="00:37:10.016" end="00:37:13.216" style="s2">worth more than my life.</p>
<p begin="00:37:28.216" end="00:37:31.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bro, bro, what&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:37:37.016" end="00:37:39.616" style="s2">Bro.</p>
<p begin="00:37:49.516" end="00:37:53.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chu Chao Yang, I was going to tell you</p>
<p begin="00:37:51.916" end="00:37:54.916" style="s2">in a few days.</p>
<p begin="00:37:53.716" end="00:37:57.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad told me what happened at the</p>
<p begin="00:37:54.916" end="00:37:59.416" style="s2">teahouse. You were even willing to put</p>
<p begin="00:37:57.016" end="00:38:02.516" style="s2">up 30,000 yuan.</p>
<p begin="00:37:59.416" end="00:38:07.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So the teahouse was a test, too?</p>
<p begin="00:38:02.516" end="00:38:07.016" style="s2">And the 200,000 yuan debt was fake.</p>
<p begin="00:38:08.916" end="00:38:12.416" style="s2">Chen Zi Xia,</p>
<p begin="00:38:11.216" end="00:38:14.916" style="s2">I thought we were figuring out how to</p>
<p begin="00:38:12.416" end="00:38:16.716" style="s2">build a life together, how much to save,</p>
<p begin="00:38:14.916" end="00:38:18.116" style="s2">how to get a bigger stall, how to pay</p>
<p begin="00:38:16.716" end="00:38:19.416" style="s2">for your mom&#39;s treatment and Xiao Yu&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:38:18.116" end="00:38:21.616" style="s2">schooling.</p>
<p begin="00:38:19.416" end="00:38:24.216" style="s2">But all along your family was giving me</p>
<p begin="00:38:21.616" end="00:38:24.216" style="s2">a score.</p>
<p begin="00:38:24.316" end="00:38:29.416" style="s2">What were the questions?</p>
<p begin="00:38:26.416" end="00:38:31.316" style="s2">I never even knew what the test was.</p>
<p begin="00:38:29.416" end="00:38:32.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, later on.</p>
<p begin="00:38:31.316" end="00:38:34.116" style="s2">I really</p>
<p begin="00:38:32.116" end="00:38:35.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t come any closer.</p>
<p begin="00:38:34.116" end="00:38:38.516" style="s2">Every time I look at you now, I feel</p>
<p begin="00:38:35.816" end="00:38:38.516" style="s2">like an idiot.</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.917" end="00:38:58.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bro, why is the light off? You look</p>
<p begin="00:38:55.817" end="00:38:58.417" style="s2">awful.</p>
<p begin="00:39:01.817" end="00:39:04.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Yu,</p>
<p begin="00:39:03.517" end="00:39:06.417" style="s2">you were right.</p>
<p begin="00:39:04.717" end="00:39:08.817" style="s2">Your brother was too trusting. I got</p>
<p begin="00:39:06.417" end="00:39:08.817" style="s2">played.</p>
<p begin="00:39:25.017" end="00:39:29.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gu Dong, what are we going to do?</p>
<p begin="00:39:36.317" end="00:39:42.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m the one who set this up.</p>
<p begin="00:39:39.517" end="00:39:42.417" style="s2">I&#39;ll own up to it.</p>
<p begin="00:39:48.017" end="00:39:51.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here, take your phone back.</p>
<p begin="00:39:49.917" end="00:39:53.117" style="s2">I gave you this scarf and now I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:39:51.617" end="00:39:56.017" style="s2">brought it back to you.</p>
<p begin="00:39:53.117" end="00:39:56.017" style="s2">Let&#39;s end things here.</p>
<p begin="00:39:56.217" end="00:40:00.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xu Xiao Yang,</p>
<p begin="00:39:57.417" end="00:40:00.717" style="s2">please don&#39;t do this.</p>
<p begin="00:40:04.817" end="00:40:08.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, ma&#39;am,</p>
<p begin="00:40:06.717" end="00:40:10.617" style="s2">I finished your test, but I can&#39;t give</p>
<p begin="00:40:08.817" end="00:40:12.517" style="s2">you the score you want.</p>
<p begin="00:40:10.617" end="00:40:13.817" style="s2">I&#39;m Xu Xiao Yang, a guy who sells</p>
<p begin="00:40:12.517" end="00:40:16.917" style="s2">breakfast.</p>
<p begin="00:40:13.817" end="00:40:16.917" style="s2">I&#39;m not good enough for you.</p>
<p begin="00:40:19.917" end="00:40:24.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xu Xiao Yang,</p>
<p begin="00:40:21.517" end="00:40:26.517" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry. I&#39;ll do anything. Just don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:40:24.417" end="00:40:28.217" style="s2">tear apart what we have too.</p>
<p begin="00:40:26.517" end="00:40:30.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That 30,000 yuan wasn&#39;t part of the</p>
<p begin="00:40:28.217" end="00:40:31.517" style="s2">test. I truly wanted to build a life</p>
<p begin="00:40:30.017" end="00:40:33.817" style="s2">with you. You were the one who turned me</p>
<p begin="00:40:31.517" end="00:40:33.817" style="s2">down.</p>
<p begin="00:40:47.517" end="00:40:49.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xu Xia,</p>
<p begin="00:40:48.517" end="00:40:49.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad,</p>
<p begin="00:40:49.517" end="00:40:52.718" style="s2">I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:40:49.818" end="00:40:52.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; want to talk right now.</p>
<p begin="00:41:07.818" end="00:41:12.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Xiao, please hear me out.</p>
<p begin="00:41:22.818" end="00:41:26.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even the illness was fake.</p>
<p begin="00:41:30.718" end="00:41:35.318" style="s2">Auntie, your leg&#39;s better now.</p>
<p begin="00:41:32.318" end="00:41:35.318" style="s2">Congratulations.</p>
<p begin="00:41:43.518" end="00:41:46.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shi Xia&#39;s mom was wrong. I shouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:41:45.418" end="00:41:49.718" style="s2">have pretended to be sick.</p>
<p begin="00:41:46.518" end="00:41:53.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, it&#39;s not your fault. It&#39;s mine.</p>
<p begin="00:41:49.718" end="00:41:53.318" style="s2">I turned your sincerity into a test.</p>
<p begin="00:42:18.718" end="00:42:24.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take that lady home, please. Huai Shu</p>
<p begin="00:42:21.118" end="00:42:24.618" style="s2">Street. Keep the change.</p>
<p begin="00:42:32.518" end="00:42:37.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss, where to?</p>
<p begin="00:42:34.918" end="00:42:37.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huai Shu Street.</p>
<p begin="00:42:40.918" end="00:42:44.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xu Tai Yang, don&#39;t go.</p>
<p begin="00:42:45.318" end="00:42:48.918" style="s2">The buns, I&#39;ll pack some for you.</p>
<p begin="00:42:58.220" end="00:43:05.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sweetheart, I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:43:01.420" end="00:43:05.620" style="s2">I won&#39;t cook up any more bad ideas.</p>
<p begin="00:43:11.520" end="00:43:15.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss, are you looking for Shu? He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:43:13.420" end="00:43:17.120" style="s2">gone. He moved his stall to the west</p>
<p begin="00:43:15.320" end="00:43:19.420" style="s2">side of town. He doesn&#39;t set up here</p>
<p begin="00:43:17.120" end="00:43:19.420" style="s2">anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:43:20.720" end="00:43:23.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where on the west side?</p>
<p begin="00:43:22.020" end="00:43:25.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How would I know?</p>
<p begin="00:43:23.520" end="00:43:27.620" style="s2">The day he left, that boy stood here for</p>
<p begin="00:43:25.720" end="00:43:29.920" style="s2">a long time, right where you&#39;re standing</p>
<p begin="00:43:27.620" end="00:43:29.920" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:43:58.820" end="00:44:06.020" style="s2">Go home, miss.</p>
<p begin="00:44:01.620" end="00:44:07.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shu&#39;s stubborn, but he&#39;s not heartless.</p>
<p begin="00:44:06.020" end="00:44:08.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Standing here every day like this will</p>
<p begin="00:44:07.520" end="00:44:11.220" style="s2">wear you down.</p>
<p begin="00:44:08.820" end="00:44:13.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, I lost him.</p>
<p begin="00:44:11.220" end="00:44:16.120" style="s2">If I don&#39;t wait here, I don&#39;t know what</p>
<p begin="00:44:13.520" end="00:44:16.120" style="s2">else to do.</p>
<p begin="00:44:24.520" end="00:44:28.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did my brother ever do to you?</p>
<p begin="00:44:26.720" end="00:44:30.420" style="s2">For the past 6 months, he&#39;s gotten up at</p>
<p begin="00:44:28.320" end="00:44:32.720" style="s2">3:00 every morning, saying he&#39;d save up</p>
<p begin="00:44:30.420" end="00:44:34.520" style="s2">and give you a proper wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:44:32.720" end="00:44:37.820" style="s2">My brother said</p>
<p begin="00:44:34.520" end="00:44:40.220" style="s2">he said someone had played him.</p>
<p begin="00:44:37.820" end="00:44:42.120" style="s2">Do you know what he did last night?</p>
<p begin="00:44:40.220" end="00:44:43.720" style="s2">He deleted every photo of you two, one</p>
<p begin="00:44:42.120" end="00:44:45.420" style="s2">by one.</p>
<p begin="00:44:43.720" end="00:44:49.220" style="s2">He kept at it until midnight, then just</p>
<p begin="00:44:45.420" end="00:44:49.220" style="s2">sat there alone like an idiot.</p>
<p begin="00:44:51.320" end="00:44:55.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Yu, I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:44:53.720" end="00:44:57.821" style="s2">I&#39;m the one who hurt your brother.</p>
<p begin="00:44:55.721" end="00:45:00.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want to hear it. I just want you</p>
<p begin="00:44:57.821" end="00:45:00.821" style="s2">to give my brother back.</p>
<p begin="00:45:10.021" end="00:45:12.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad,</p>
<p begin="00:45:11.021" end="00:45:13.921" style="s2">mom,</p>
<p begin="00:45:12.221" end="00:45:17.321" style="s2">I&#39;m the one who lost him,</p>
<p begin="00:45:13.921" end="00:45:19.121" style="s2">so I&#39;ll find him myself.</p>
<p begin="00:45:17.321" end="00:45:20.821" style="s2">No matter how much he hates me, no</p>
<p begin="00:45:19.121" end="00:45:22.721" style="s2">matter how long it takes.</p>
<p begin="00:45:20.821" end="00:45:25.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Think it through. Once you swallow your</p>
<p begin="00:45:22.721" end="00:45:29.721" style="s2">pride, you can&#39;t take it back.</p>
<p begin="00:45:25.721" end="00:45:29.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have no pride when it comes to him.</p>
<p begin="00:45:34.021" end="00:45:38.221" style="s2">Hongguang Market, west side of town.</p>
<p begin="00:45:39.221" end="00:45:43.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Old Shen.</p>
<p begin="00:45:41.321" end="00:45:45.821" style="s2">Do you think young Shen might change his</p>
<p begin="00:45:43.321" end="00:45:45.821" style="s2">mind?</p>
<p begin="00:45:46.421" end="00:45:50.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have to meet sincerity with</p>
<p begin="00:45:47.921" end="00:45:50.521" style="s2">sincerity.</p>
<p begin="00:45:52.321" end="00:45:56.921" style="s2">Our daughter has to make things right,</p>
<p begin="00:45:54.321" end="00:45:58.921" style="s2">little by little.</p>
<p begin="00:45:56.921" end="00:46:01.121" style="s2">All we can do is keep that run-down</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.921" end="00:46:04.421" style="s2">repair shop going.</p>
<p begin="00:46:01.121" end="00:46:04.421" style="s2">It&#39;s where those two met.</p>
<p begin="00:46:15.721" end="00:46:18.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re sold out.</p>
<p begin="00:46:27.721" end="00:46:31.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, young man, you&#39;ve still got some</p>
<p begin="00:46:29.621" end="00:46:35.321" style="s2">left. Sir, these are for you. Buns are</p>
<p begin="00:46:31.621" end="00:46:35.321" style="s2">two bucks. Soy milk&#39;s on the house.</p>
<p begin="00:46:43.521" end="00:46:46.221" style="s2">We&#39;re sold out.</p>
<p begin="00:46:48.821" end="00:46:54.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That young lady comes every day, waits</p>
<p begin="00:46:51.221" end="00:46:55.421" style="s2">in line every day, and never gets to buy</p>
<p begin="00:46:54.121" end="00:46:57.521" style="s2">anything.</p>
<p begin="00:46:55.421" end="00:46:57.723" style="s2">What does she keep coming for?</p>
<p begin="00:46:57.521" end="00:46:59.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That</p>
<p begin="00:46:57.723" end="00:47:02.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; woman in the news, the chairwoman of</p>
<p begin="00:46:59.622" end="00:47:02.422" style="s2">Hengsheng Group.</p>
<p begin="00:47:03.823" end="00:47:07.922" style="s2">She&#39;s the one who deceived Xu Chaoyang.</p>
<p begin="00:47:09.323" end="00:47:14.723" style="s2">My brother said not to talk to her,</p>
<p begin="00:47:12.523" end="00:47:17.823" style="s2">but she comes at 4:00 every morning.</p>
<p begin="00:47:14.723" end="00:47:17.823" style="s2">Her hands are purple with cold.</p>
<p begin="00:47:29.523" end="00:47:32.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncle</p>
<p begin="00:47:30.622" end="00:47:34.422" style="s2">Chaoyang,</p>
<p begin="00:47:32.523" end="00:47:36.622" style="s2">I came to apologize.</p>
<p begin="00:47:34.422" end="00:47:37.922" style="s2">I was the one who made Zhixia pretend we</p>
<p begin="00:47:36.622" end="00:47:40.023" style="s2">were poor.</p>
<p begin="00:47:37.922" end="00:47:42.523" style="s2">I came up with the tests and I made up</p>
<p begin="00:47:40.023" end="00:47:42.523" style="s2">the debt.</p>
<p begin="00:47:42.723" end="00:47:47.422" style="s2">If you&#39;re angry, be angry with me. If</p>
<p begin="00:47:45.023" end="00:47:49.823" style="s2">you want to blame someone, blame me.</p>
<p begin="00:47:47.422" end="00:47:53.523" style="s2">Don&#39;t blame that girl.</p>
<p begin="00:47:49.823" end="00:47:53.523" style="s2">Her feelings were real later on.</p>
<p begin="00:47:54.023" end="00:47:58.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncle, please don&#39;t put yourself through</p>
<p begin="00:47:55.723" end="00:47:58.023" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="00:48:02.823" end="00:48:06.023" style="s2">It&#39;s cold. Have some to warm up then</p>
<p begin="00:48:05.023" end="00:48:06.922" style="s2">head home.</p>
<p begin="00:48:06.023" end="00:48:09.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about Zhixia?</p>
<p begin="00:48:06.922" end="00:48:10.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncle, the soy milk&#39;s on me.</p>
<p begin="00:48:09.023" end="00:48:12.723" style="s2">I don&#39;t want to talk about anything else</p>
<p begin="00:48:10.323" end="00:48:12.723" style="s2">right now.</p>
<p begin="00:48:21.323" end="00:48:27.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bro, Shen Zhixia&#39;s dad came by today.</p>
<p begin="00:48:24.723" end="00:48:28.323" style="s2">I saw him bow to you.</p>
<p begin="00:48:27.122" end="00:48:30.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:48:28.323" end="00:48:31.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s a big-time businessman and he came</p>
<p begin="00:48:30.122" end="00:48:33.823" style="s2">in person to apologize.</p>
<p begin="00:48:31.823" end="00:48:35.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiaoyu,</p>
<p begin="00:48:33.823" end="00:48:36.922" style="s2">you can take back a cup of soy milk</p>
<p begin="00:48:35.323" end="00:48:40.922" style="s2">you&#39;ve given away,</p>
<p begin="00:48:36.922" end="00:48:40.922" style="s2">but a glued-up bowl still has cracks.</p>
<p begin="00:48:42.323" end="00:48:46.723" style="s2">It&#39;s not that I won&#39;t forgive her,</p>
<p begin="00:48:45.023" end="00:48:49.023" style="s2">I just don&#39;t know how.</p>
<p begin="00:48:46.723" end="00:48:50.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey Chaoyang, who was that old man? He</p>
<p begin="00:48:49.023" end="00:48:53.523" style="s2">doesn&#39;t look like an ordinary guy, but</p>
<p begin="00:48:50.823" end="00:48:55.922" style="s2">he&#39;s dressed like that.</p>
<p begin="00:48:53.523" end="00:48:58.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I recognize him. He was in the news the</p>
<p begin="00:48:55.922" end="00:48:59.523" style="s2">other day. The chairman of Hengsheng</p>
<p begin="00:48:58.223" end="00:48:59.824" style="s2">Group.</p>
<p begin="00:48:59.523" end="00:49:02.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good</p>
<p begin="00:48:59.824" end="00:49:05.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; grief. A tycoon worth billions just</p>
<p begin="00:49:02.324" end="00:49:07.324" style="s2">bowed to Qiao Yang.</p>
<p begin="00:49:05.424" end="00:49:09.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So Qiao Yang landed himself a rich</p>
<p begin="00:49:07.324" end="00:49:09.824" style="s2">heiress?</p>
<p begin="00:49:10.524" end="00:49:14.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t land anyone</p>
<p begin="00:49:12.124" end="00:49:14.924" style="s2">and I don&#39;t want to.</p>
<p begin="00:49:15.124" end="00:49:20.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You fool. That&#39;s the kind of luck people</p>
<p begin="00:49:17.024" end="00:49:20.524" style="s2">dream of for generations.</p>
<p begin="00:49:20.924" end="00:49:23.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir,</p>
<p begin="00:49:23.424" end="00:49:27.524" style="s2">I&#39;m not mad because they&#39;re rich.</p>
<p begin="00:49:26.024" end="00:49:28.924" style="s2">If I&#39;d known her family was rich, I&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:49:27.524" end="00:49:31.724" style="s2">have walked away.</p>
<p begin="00:49:28.924" end="00:49:33.924" style="s2">I wouldn&#39;t have pursued her.</p>
<p begin="00:49:31.724" end="00:49:35.924" style="s2">What I&#39;m mad about is</p>
<p begin="00:49:33.924" end="00:49:38.424" style="s2">I gave her my whole heart and she didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:49:35.924" end="00:49:38.424" style="s2">trust me.</p>
<p begin="00:49:41.024" end="00:49:45.424" style="s2">If she trusted me,</p>
<p begin="00:49:43.524" end="00:49:47.324" style="s2">she would have told me from the start.</p>
<p begin="00:49:45.424" end="00:49:49.724" style="s2">By hiding it from me, she showed she</p>
<p begin="00:49:47.324" end="00:49:51.624" style="s2">truly thought that if I, Shu Qiao Yang,</p>
<p begin="00:49:49.724" end="00:49:53.324" style="s2">knew the truth, I&#39;d turn into someone</p>
<p begin="00:49:51.624" end="00:49:55.824" style="s2">else.</p>
<p begin="00:49:53.324" end="00:49:58.124" style="s2">In her eyes, I&#39;m no different from those</p>
<p begin="00:49:55.824" end="00:49:58.124" style="s2">men</p>
<p begin="00:49:58.324" end="00:50:01.324" style="s2">who only care about money.</p>
<p begin="00:50:01.724" end="00:50:07.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bro, deep down, are you really not mad</p>
<p begin="00:50:04.824" end="00:50:07.524" style="s2">at her anymore?</p>
<p begin="00:50:12.724" end="00:50:15.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am</p>
<p begin="00:50:13.924" end="00:50:16.924" style="s2">and I&#39;m not.</p>
<p begin="00:50:15.124" end="00:50:19.024" style="s2">I&#39;m mad she lied to me, but if she were</p>
<p begin="00:50:16.924" end="00:50:22.724" style="s2">a bad person, that&#39;d be one thing. The</p>
<p begin="00:50:19.024" end="00:50:22.724" style="s2">thing is she&#39;s better than anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:50:32.024" end="00:50:35.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ms. Shen, we don&#39;t get involved in your</p>
<p begin="00:50:33.824" end="00:50:37.124" style="s2">personal life, but this scandal is</p>
<p begin="00:50:35.424" end="00:50:39.424" style="s2">everywhere and the stocks already</p>
<p begin="00:50:37.124" end="00:50:39.424" style="s2">falling.</p>
<p begin="00:50:39.924" end="00:50:44.324" style="s2">I think we need to put someone else in</p>
<p begin="00:50:41.224" end="00:50:44.324" style="s2">charge of Yunshi Bay.</p>
<p begin="00:50:45.224" end="00:50:48.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chi Xia, I&#39;m only trying to help you.</p>
<p begin="00:50:47.424" end="00:50:51.524" style="s2">There&#39;s a lot going on behind the scenes</p>
<p begin="00:50:48.924" end="00:50:53.424" style="s2">with this project and lately you haven&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:50:51.524" end="00:50:56.424" style="s2">been yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:50:53.424" end="00:50:56.424" style="s2">Why not let me take over?</p>
<p begin="00:51:00.324" end="00:51:04.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The stock&#39;s fallen.</p>
<p begin="00:51:01.824" end="00:51:06.025" style="s2">I&#39;ll bring it back up.</p>
<p begin="00:51:04.125" end="00:51:07.725" style="s2">As for Yunchi Bay,</p>
<p begin="00:51:06.025" end="00:51:08.725" style="s2">I won&#39;t give up an inch.</p>
<p begin="00:51:07.725" end="00:51:09.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And what makes you think you can do</p>
<p begin="00:51:08.725" end="00:51:11.725" style="s2">that?</p>
<p begin="00:51:09.725" end="00:51:14.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I spent a whole year on this project,</p>
<p begin="00:51:11.725" end="00:51:16.725" style="s2">measuring every last alley myself,</p>
<p begin="00:51:14.125" end="00:51:18.825" style="s2">and I&#39;m determined to see it through.</p>
<p begin="00:51:16.725" end="00:51:21.125" style="s2">Not to prove a point to anyone, but to</p>
<p begin="00:51:18.825" end="00:51:22.725" style="s2">set the record straight.</p>
<p begin="00:51:21.125" end="00:51:24.125" style="s2">Hang Shang is building Yunchi Bay with a</p>
<p begin="00:51:22.725" end="00:51:25.925" style="s2">clear conscience.</p>
<p begin="00:51:24.125" end="00:51:29.125" style="s2">Anyone who tries to interfere will have</p>
<p begin="00:51:25.925" end="00:51:29.125" style="s2">to get past me first.</p>
<p begin="00:51:30.225" end="00:51:32.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Shen.</p>
<p begin="00:51:33.325" end="00:51:37.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t try to talk me out of it.</p>
<p begin="00:51:35.425" end="00:51:39.925" style="s2">I lost him.</p>
<p begin="00:51:37.725" end="00:51:41.725" style="s2">Someone has to prove</p>
<p begin="00:51:39.925" end="00:51:44.125" style="s2">he didn&#39;t fall for some ungrateful</p>
<p begin="00:51:41.725" end="00:51:44.125" style="s2">woman.</p>
<p begin="00:51:53.725" end="00:51:59.025" style="s2">Notify the project team on-site meeting</p>
<p begin="00:51:55.925" end="00:52:00.025" style="s2">at Yunchi Bay tomorrow at 8 a.m. I will</p>
<p begin="00:51:59.025" end="00:52:02.825" style="s2">attend personally.</p>
<p begin="00:52:00.025" end="00:52:04.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Shen, you haven&#39;t slept all night.</p>
<p begin="00:52:02.825" end="00:52:07.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even if the sky falls, someone&#39;s got to</p>
<p begin="00:52:04.825" end="00:52:07.325" style="s2">hold it up.</p>
<p begin="00:52:13.525" end="00:52:18.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Qiao Yang, starting next month, the</p>
<p begin="00:52:15.725" end="00:52:20.525" style="s2">stall rent is going up threefold.</p>
<p begin="00:52:18.525" end="00:52:22.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss Qian, we agreed on the price. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:52:20.525" end="00:52:24.825" style="s2">right there in writing.</p>
<p begin="00:52:22.225" end="00:52:29.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I only have one thing to say. Rent it or</p>
<p begin="00:52:24.825" end="00:52:29.925" style="s2">don&#39;t. If you don&#39;t want it, get lost.</p>
<p begin="00:52:36.125" end="00:52:41.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chef Su, it&#39;s all a misunderstanding.</p>
<p begin="00:52:39.125" end="00:52:44.625" style="s2">I&#39;m not raising the rent, not a cent.</p>
<p begin="00:52:41.625" end="00:52:48.525" style="s2">It&#39;ll stay the same as before. You,</p>
<p begin="00:52:44.625" end="00:52:48.525" style="s2">please be the bigger man.</p>
<p begin="00:52:57.125" end="00:53:02.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shen Jia Shan,</p>
<p begin="00:52:59.125" end="00:53:02.425" style="s2">I don&#39;t need your handouts.</p>
<p begin="00:53:12.027" end="00:53:15.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I even managed to mess up trying to help</p>
<p begin="00:53:13.927" end="00:53:18.727" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="00:53:15.927" end="00:53:21.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chef Sue, dinner&#39;s on me tonight. Let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:53:18.727" end="00:53:21.327" style="s2">have a drink.</p>
<p begin="00:53:24.327" end="00:53:29.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just one question.</p>
<p begin="00:53:25.927" end="00:53:29.027" style="s2">Who came to see you yesterday?</p>
<p begin="00:53:30.927" end="00:53:35.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nobody. I just came to my senses.</p>
<p begin="00:53:58.327" end="00:54:01.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:54:32.527" end="00:54:38.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shishi comes every day.</p>
<p begin="00:54:34.827" end="00:54:42.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, five days straight, rain or shine.</p>
<p begin="00:54:38.027" end="00:54:42.127" style="s2">Man, your girlfriend&#39;s a real tough one.</p>
<p begin="00:54:42.727" end="00:54:46.627" style="s2">The first day, she couldn&#39;t even carry</p>
<p begin="00:54:44.227" end="00:54:48.827" style="s2">50 lbs. Now, she&#39;s stocking stock with</p>
<p begin="00:54:46.627" end="00:54:48.827" style="s2">us.</p>
<p begin="00:55:06.627" end="00:55:09.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Drink up. It&#39;ll warm you up.</p>
<p begin="00:55:30.128" end="00:55:33.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t think I&#39;ve forgiven you.</p>
<p begin="00:55:31.728" end="00:55:36.928" style="s2">I just saw how messed up your hands are</p>
<p begin="00:55:33.628" end="00:55:36.928" style="s2">and it bothers my brother to see them.</p>
<p begin="00:55:37.428" end="00:55:41.328" style="s2">Thanks, Xiao Yu.</p>
<p begin="00:55:39.728" end="00:55:44.728" style="s2">Are you coming back tomorrow?</p>
<p begin="00:55:41.328" end="00:55:44.728" style="s2">If you are, I&#39;ll bring you a back brace.</p>
<p begin="00:55:59.428" end="00:56:03.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s him, the kept man.</p>
<p begin="00:56:01.828" end="00:56:06.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey man, teach us your tricks. How&#39;d you</p>
<p begin="00:56:03.828" end="00:56:06.928" style="s2">land yourself a rich woman?</p>
<p begin="00:56:14.128" end="00:56:16.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So Xiao Yu, your brother&#39;s that kept</p>
<p begin="00:56:15.628" end="00:56:17.728" style="s2">man, right?</p>
<p begin="00:56:16.728" end="00:56:20.628" style="s2">Guess you don&#39;t need to take the college</p>
<p begin="00:56:17.728" end="00:56:20.628" style="s2">entrance exam now, huh?</p>
<p begin="00:56:23.113" end="00:56:25.133" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:56:26.328" end="00:56:30.928" style="s2">Tell your brother to set us up with some</p>
<p begin="00:56:28.028" end="00:56:30.928" style="s2">rich women too.</p>
<p begin="00:56:31.528" end="00:56:36.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My brother isn&#39;t Stop making things up.</p>
<p begin="00:56:45.128" end="00:56:47.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does it hurt?</p>
<p begin="00:56:48.628" end="00:56:52.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bro,</p>
<p begin="00:56:50.328" end="00:56:54.228" style="s2">I&#39;m fine.</p>
<p begin="00:56:52.928" end="00:56:55.728" style="s2">I&#39;m just mad.</p>
<p begin="00:56:54.228" end="00:56:58.328" style="s2">What gives them the right to talk about</p>
<p begin="00:56:55.728" end="00:56:58.328" style="s2">you like that?</p>
<p begin="00:57:00.928" end="00:57:04.728" style="s2">You get up at 3:00 in the morning.</p>
<p begin="00:57:03.028" end="00:57:06.028" style="s2">You stand on your feet for over 10 hours</p>
<p begin="00:57:04.728" end="00:57:08.628" style="s2">a day.</p>
<p begin="00:57:06.028" end="00:57:11.529" style="s2">Every penny you earn is honest.</p>
<p begin="00:57:08.628" end="00:57:11.529" style="s2">What gives them the right?</p>
<p begin="00:57:16.929" end="00:57:22.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Yu, I&#39;m fine.</p>
<p begin="00:57:19.429" end="00:57:22.929" style="s2">People can say whatever they want.</p>
<p begin="00:57:37.929" end="00:57:40.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;3 Shen Zhisha. Thank you all for</p>
<p begin="00:57:39.529" end="00:57:42.729" style="s2">coming.</p>
<p begin="00:57:40.729" end="00:57:45.129" style="s2">About the rumors going around online, I</p>
<p begin="00:57:42.729" end="00:57:46.929" style="s2">have just three things to say. First,</p>
<p begin="00:57:45.129" end="00:57:49.229" style="s2">the fake poor act on our blind date was</p>
<p begin="00:57:46.929" end="00:57:52.029" style="s2">a setup by my parents and me. Xu Chao</p>
<p begin="00:57:49.229" end="00:57:53.929" style="s2">Yang had no idea. Second, I was the one</p>
<p begin="00:57:52.029" end="00:57:56.029" style="s2">chasing him. I was the one who wouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:57:53.929" end="00:57:58.329" style="s2">take no for an answer. He never took a</p>
<p begin="00:57:56.029" end="00:58:00.029" style="s2">cent from me. If anything, I&#39;m the one</p>
<p begin="00:57:58.329" end="00:58:01.329" style="s2">who owes him an apology.</p>
<p begin="00:58:00.029" end="00:58:03.029" style="s2">Third,</p>
<p begin="00:58:01.329" end="00:58:04.529" style="s2">he gets up at 3:00 every morning and</p>
<p begin="00:58:03.029" end="00:58:05.929" style="s2">supports his family with his own two</p>
<p begin="00:58:04.529" end="00:58:07.429" style="s2">hands.</p>
<p begin="00:58:05.929" end="00:58:09.429" style="s2">He&#39;s more honest and respectable than</p>
<p begin="00:58:07.429" end="00:58:11.529" style="s2">anyone I&#39;ve ever known.</p>
<p begin="00:58:09.429" end="00:58:13.229" style="s2">From today on, anyone who spreads</p>
<p begin="00:58:11.529" end="00:58:16.329" style="s2">another lie about him will hear from</p>
<p begin="00:58:13.229" end="00:58:16.329" style="s2">Heng Sheng&#39;s legal team.</p>
<p begin="00:58:33.529" end="00:58:38.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re a good kid. You&#39;ve been through</p>
<p begin="00:58:35.929" end="00:58:38.529" style="s2">enough.</p>
<p begin="00:58:38.829" end="00:58:43.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s a good woman. Don&#39;t be so</p>
<p begin="00:58:40.629" end="00:58:43.229" style="s2">stubborn.</p>
<p begin="00:58:45.229" end="00:58:49.229" style="s2">Grandma, your nails a little long. Bear</p>
<p begin="00:58:47.529" end="00:58:49.729" style="s2">with me, okay? I&#39;ll have it trimmed in a</p>
<p begin="00:58:49.229" end="00:58:53.329" style="s2">second.</p>
<p begin="00:58:49.729" end="00:58:53.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re a good girl.</p>
<p begin="00:58:54.029" end="00:58:57.929" style="s2">Where&#39;s that boy Chao Yang?</p>
<p begin="00:58:58.029" end="00:59:04.329" style="s2">Having a good wife like you, he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:59:00.629" end="00:59:04.329" style="s2">luckier than he knows.</p>
<p begin="00:59:05.729" end="00:59:08.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandma, I</p>
<p begin="00:59:06.929" end="00:59:11.631" style="s2">I&#39;m not his.</p>
<p begin="00:59:08.029" end="00:59:14.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, you are. These old eyes can right</p>
<p begin="00:59:11.631" end="00:59:14.631" style="s2">through people.</p>
<p begin="00:59:22.231" end="00:59:26.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandma, no one&#39;s here to look after</p>
<p begin="00:59:23.831" end="00:59:27.731" style="s2">you, so I I&#39;ve hired a caregiver.</p>
<p begin="00:59:26.131" end="00:59:30.131" style="s2">They&#39;ll be here this afternoon. I should</p>
<p begin="00:59:27.731" end="00:59:30.131" style="s2">get going.</p>
<p begin="00:59:30.831" end="00:59:35.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold it right there. If you let a good</p>
<p begin="00:59:33.031" end="00:59:39.131" style="s2">girl like her get away, I&#39;ll be the</p>
<p begin="00:59:35.131" end="00:59:39.131" style="s2">first to break your legs.</p>
<p begin="00:59:50.231" end="00:59:56.431" style="s2">That boy Xiao Yang has had a hard life.</p>
<p begin="00:59:53.831" end="00:59:59.331" style="s2">He lost his father at 18. He had to be</p>
<p begin="00:59:56.431" end="01:00:01.331" style="s2">both brother and father raising Xiao Yu</p>
<p begin="00:59:59.331" end="01:00:05.831" style="s2">all on his own.</p>
<p begin="01:00:01.331" end="01:00:05.831" style="s2">Good girl, please take good care of him.</p>
<p begin="01:00:09.431" end="01:00:15.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandma, I will.</p>
<p begin="01:00:12.031" end="01:00:15.531" style="s2">I&#39;ll love him with all my heart.</p>
<p begin="01:00:25.131" end="01:00:27.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sit down.</p>
<p begin="01:00:32.331" end="01:00:35.331" style="s2">Shen Jia Shuo, I just want to ask you</p>
<p begin="01:00:34.031" end="01:00:38.731" style="s2">one thing.</p>
<p begin="01:00:35.331" end="01:00:40.631" style="s2">What do you really want from me?</p>
<p begin="01:00:38.731" end="01:00:42.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because the first time you met my mom,</p>
<p begin="01:00:40.631" end="01:00:44.131" style="s2">you didn&#39;t ask about her money or look</p>
<p begin="01:00:42.331" end="01:00:46.331" style="s2">down on her for being paralyzed.</p>
<p begin="01:00:44.131" end="01:00:47.831" style="s2">You just offered her a hot bun because</p>
<p begin="01:00:46.331" end="01:00:50.031" style="s2">you saved soy milk for the street</p>
<p begin="01:00:47.831" end="01:00:52.031" style="s2">cleaners and the misshapen buns for</p>
<p begin="01:00:50.031" end="01:00:54.831" style="s2">Grandpa Ma.</p>
<p begin="01:00:52.031" end="01:00:58.431" style="s2">You never looked down on me</p>
<p begin="01:00:54.831" end="01:00:58.431" style="s2">even when I was just a waitress.</p>
<p begin="01:01:00.931" end="01:01:04.731" style="s2">Xu Xiao Yang,</p>
<p begin="01:01:02.831" end="01:01:06.231" style="s2">I&#39;ve spent 10 years surrounded by people</p>
<p begin="01:01:04.731" end="01:01:10.431" style="s2">sucking up to me,</p>
<p begin="01:01:06.231" end="01:01:10.431" style="s2">but with you, I can just be myself.</p>
<p begin="01:01:11.331" end="01:01:14.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m just a breakfast vendor.</p>
<p begin="01:01:13.031" end="01:01:17.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="01:01:14.231" end="01:01:17.132" style="s2">I know all that.</p>
<p begin="01:01:24.432" end="01:01:27.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just give me a little more time.</p>
<p begin="01:01:33.332" end="01:01:37.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Yang, remember when we make food,</p>
<p begin="01:01:35.332" end="01:01:39.232" style="s2">our hands must be clean so our hearts</p>
<p begin="01:01:37.532" end="01:01:41.432" style="s2">can be clean too.</p>
<p begin="01:01:39.232" end="01:01:44.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;d rather go hungry than let a customer</p>
<p begin="01:01:41.432" end="01:01:46.932" style="s2">eat anything that&#39;s not clean.</p>
<p begin="01:01:44.332" end="01:01:49.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In this life, you earn your own dignity.</p>
<p begin="01:01:46.932" end="01:01:52.832" style="s2">No one else can give it to you.</p>
<p begin="01:01:49.832" end="01:01:54.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, can we make a lot of money?</p>
<p begin="01:01:52.832" end="01:01:57.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe not a lot, but we can earn a clear</p>
<p begin="01:01:54.932" end="01:01:59.732" style="s2">conscience, and with that, we&#39;ll sleep</p>
<p begin="01:01:57.432" end="01:01:59.732" style="s2">easy.</p>
<p begin="01:01:59.932" end="01:02:04.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad,</p>
<p begin="01:02:01.932" end="01:02:06.932" style="s2">you said a person&#39;s dignity matters, but</p>
<p begin="01:02:04.732" end="01:02:10.132" style="s2">I nearly let my pride push away someone</p>
<p begin="01:02:06.932" end="01:02:10.132" style="s2">who truly cared about me.</p>
<p begin="01:02:12.932" end="01:02:15.932" style="s2">If she really looked down on people</p>
<p begin="01:02:14.332" end="01:02:18.832" style="s2">without money,</p>
<p begin="01:02:15.932" end="01:02:21.632" style="s2">would she have gone this far for me?</p>
<p begin="01:02:18.832" end="01:02:21.632" style="s2">I was a fool.</p>
<p begin="01:02:21.932" end="01:02:27.332" style="s2">I took her test</p>
<p begin="01:02:24.032" end="01:02:27.332" style="s2">as proof she looked down on me.</p>
<p begin="01:02:33.132" end="01:02:38.232" style="s2">Shen Zhi Xiao, let&#39;s give us another</p>
<p begin="01:02:34.932" end="01:02:39.932" style="s2">chance. No tests, no setups. Let&#39;s lay</p>
<p begin="01:02:38.232" end="01:02:41.332" style="s2">all our cards on the table. You&#39;re the</p>
<p begin="01:02:39.932" end="01:02:43.332" style="s2">CEO of Heng Sheng.</p>
<p begin="01:02:41.332" end="01:02:44.932" style="s2">I&#39;m Shu Xiao Yang, the breakfast vendor.</p>
<p begin="01:02:43.332" end="01:02:48.732" style="s2">If you&#39;re still willing,</p>
<p begin="01:02:44.932" end="01:02:48.732" style="s2">we can start over right here.</p>
<p begin="01:03:07.632" end="01:03:13.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Su, I lied to you. I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:03:11.732" end="01:03:15.732" style="s2">When you rubbed my legs, made pastries,</p>
<p begin="01:03:13.732" end="01:03:17.832" style="s2">and wheeled me out for some sun, I felt</p>
<p begin="01:03:15.732" end="01:03:19.233" style="s2">worse than anyone, but you also warmed</p>
<p begin="01:03:17.832" end="01:03:20.933" style="s2">my heart more than anyone.</p>
<p begin="01:03:19.233" end="01:03:23.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all in the past, Nancy. Please, get</p>
<p begin="01:03:20.933" end="01:03:23.133" style="s2">up.</p>
<p begin="01:03:27.033" end="01:03:32.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Yunxi Bay project.</p>
<p begin="01:03:29.033" end="01:03:34.733" style="s2">The board approved it unanimously.</p>
<p begin="01:03:32.233" end="01:03:37.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad.</p>
<p begin="01:03:34.733" end="01:03:37.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This time,</p>
<p begin="01:03:37.533" end="01:03:42.733" style="s2">you don&#39;t have to trade anything for it.</p>
<p begin="01:03:39.933" end="01:03:44.933" style="s2">This project was yours all along.</p>
<p begin="01:03:42.733" end="01:03:46.033" style="s2">I always wanted to pave a sure path for</p>
<p begin="01:03:44.933" end="01:03:47.633" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:03:46.033" end="01:03:49.133" style="s2">But now I understand.</p>
<p begin="01:03:47.633" end="01:03:53.433" style="s2">The path you choose for yourself is</p>
<p begin="01:03:49.133" end="01:03:53.433" style="s2">steadier than any path I could pave.</p>
<p begin="01:04:00.933" end="01:04:05.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandma, try some of this.</p>
<p begin="01:04:02.333" end="01:04:05.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll share.</p>
<p begin="01:04:16.733" end="01:04:22.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is Zhixia&#39;s boyfriend. I hear he</p>
<p begin="01:04:19.133" end="01:04:22.233" style="s2">sells breakfast.</p>
<p begin="01:04:23.933" end="01:04:27.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s Zhixia thinking?</p>
<p begin="01:04:25.733" end="01:04:29.333" style="s2">A family like ours and she finds a guy</p>
<p begin="01:04:27.633" end="01:04:31.633" style="s2">who sells buns?</p>
<p begin="01:04:29.333" end="01:04:33.433" style="s2">People will laugh at us.</p>
<p begin="01:04:31.633" end="01:04:35.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. They&#39;re from completely</p>
<p begin="01:04:33.433" end="01:04:38.533" style="s2">different worlds. He looks like a gold</p>
<p begin="01:04:35.333" end="01:04:38.533" style="s2">digger trying to marry up.</p>
<p begin="01:04:40.733" end="01:04:45.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young man, how many people are in your</p>
<p begin="01:04:42.433" end="01:04:47.133" style="s2">family? What do your parents do?</p>
<p begin="01:04:45.133" end="01:04:49.233" style="s2">Oh, they sell breakfast too. So you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:04:47.133" end="01:04:51.133" style="s2">entrepreneurs then.</p>
<p begin="01:04:49.233" end="01:04:54.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brother Guo Liang, don&#39;t scare the poor</p>
<p begin="01:04:51.133" end="01:04:55.833" style="s2">guy. He only makes a few cents per bun.</p>
<p begin="01:04:54.233" end="01:04:58.333" style="s2">He&#39;s probably never even seen a check</p>
<p begin="01:04:55.833" end="01:04:58.333" style="s2">before.</p>
<p begin="01:05:09.533" end="01:05:13.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young man, name your price. Leave</p>
<p begin="01:05:11.433" end="01:05:17.233" style="s2">Zhixia. This much is enough to keep you</p>
<p begin="01:05:13.433" end="01:05:17.233" style="s2">selling buns for generations.</p>
<p begin="01:05:23.235" end="01:05:28.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncle, I make 300 yuan a day. Every cent</p>
<p begin="01:05:26.635" end="01:05:30.435" style="s2">of it is honest money I earn with my own</p>
<p begin="01:05:28.835" end="01:05:32.935" style="s2">hands, getting up at 3:00 in the</p>
<p begin="01:05:30.435" end="01:05:32.935" style="s2">morning.</p>
<p begin="01:05:33.335" end="01:05:36.835" style="s2">How much do you make in a year?</p>
<p begin="01:05:35.335" end="01:05:39.235" style="s2">That&#39;s none of my business, and I&#39;m not</p>
<p begin="01:05:36.835" end="01:05:39.235" style="s2">jealous.</p>
<p begin="01:05:40.435" end="01:05:44.835" style="s2">But humiliating someone at the dinner</p>
<p begin="01:05:41.635" end="01:05:46.235" style="s2">table is something no amount of money</p>
<p begin="01:05:44.835" end="01:05:49.035" style="s2">can make up for.</p>
<p begin="01:05:46.235" end="01:05:49.035" style="s2">It takes class.</p>
<p begin="01:05:49.835" end="01:05:53.135" style="s2">I know you look down on me.</p>
<p begin="01:05:51.735" end="01:05:56.735" style="s2">That&#39;s okay.</p>
<p begin="01:05:53.135" end="01:05:58.735" style="s2">I came here not to win your approval,</p>
<p begin="01:05:56.735" end="01:06:00.435" style="s2">but to tell Ji Xiao she chose the right</p>
<p begin="01:05:58.735" end="01:06:04.635" style="s2">man.</p>
<p begin="01:06:00.435" end="01:06:04.635" style="s2">I&#39;m poor, but I&#39;m an honest man.</p>
<p begin="01:06:06.835" end="01:06:12.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone, take a good look.</p>
<p begin="01:06:09.535" end="01:06:16.335" style="s2">Xu Chao Yang is the man I&#39;ve chosen, the</p>
<p begin="01:06:12.735" end="01:06:16.335" style="s2">man I&#39;m going to marry.</p>
<p begin="01:06:18.335" end="01:06:22.735" style="s2">From today on, if anyone brings up his</p>
<p begin="01:06:20.435" end="01:06:24.335" style="s2">background again, you&#39;re insulting me</p>
<p begin="01:06:22.735" end="01:06:26.935" style="s2">and picking a fight with all of Heng</p>
<p begin="01:06:24.335" end="01:06:26.935" style="s2">Sheng Group.</p>
<p begin="01:06:27.685" end="01:06:29.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="01:06:40.935" end="01:06:45.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is my grandson. He gets up at 3:00</p>
<p begin="01:06:43.735" end="01:06:48.835" style="s2">in the morning to put his sister through</p>
<p begin="01:06:45.535" end="01:06:50.235" style="s2">school and takes care of an old woman</p>
<p begin="01:06:48.835" end="01:06:53.635" style="s2">like me.</p>
<p begin="01:06:50.235" end="01:06:56.235" style="s2">He&#39;s never earned a dirty cent.</p>
<p begin="01:06:53.635" end="01:07:00.635" style="s2">If anyone says he&#39;s not good enough,</p>
<p begin="01:06:56.235" end="01:07:00.635" style="s2">they&#39;ll have to get past me first.</p>
<p begin="01:07:08.335" end="01:07:12.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone, since we&#39;re all here today, I</p>
<p begin="01:07:10.335" end="01:07:14.435" style="s2">should confess something as a mother. To</p>
<p begin="01:07:12.235" end="01:07:16.035" style="s2">test Shen Zhi Xiao&#39;s future husband, I</p>
<p begin="01:07:14.435" end="01:07:18.535" style="s2">pretended to be paralyzed and stayed in</p>
<p begin="01:07:16.035" end="01:07:20.635" style="s2">bed. But then, little Su came every day</p>
<p begin="01:07:18.535" end="01:07:22.235" style="s2">to massage my legs, make me soft rice</p>
<p begin="01:07:20.635" end="01:07:23.235" style="s2">cakes, and wheel me outside for some</p>
<p begin="01:07:22.235" end="01:07:25.036" style="s2">sun.</p>
<p begin="01:07:23.235" end="01:07:26.736" style="s2">He took such good care of his fake sick</p>
<p begin="01:07:25.036" end="01:07:29.336" style="s2">mother-in-law. I was too embarrassed to</p>
<p begin="01:07:26.736" end="01:07:29.336" style="s2">keep pretending.</p>
<p begin="01:07:32.836" end="01:07:36.436" style="s2">So if anyone says a single bad word</p>
<p begin="01:07:34.436" end="01:07:39.036" style="s2">about our little Shu, they&#39;ll have me to</p>
<p begin="01:07:36.436" end="01:07:39.036" style="s2">answer to.</p>
<p begin="01:07:39.436" end="01:07:43.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That boy&#39;s heart is pure gold.</p>
<p begin="01:07:56.036" end="01:07:59.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone and all our elders, I have to</p>
<p begin="01:07:57.936" end="01:08:02.436" style="s2">get up at 3:00 in the morning, so I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:07:59.236" end="01:08:02.436" style="s2">toast with tea instead.</p>
<p begin="01:08:06.336" end="01:08:10.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. Zhao Wang is right.</p>
<p begin="01:08:08.636" end="01:08:13.536" style="s2">Everyone take a good look. Shu Zhao Wang</p>
<p begin="01:08:10.936" end="01:08:16.136" style="s2">is the son-in-law I, Shen Guo Dong, have</p>
<p begin="01:08:13.536" end="01:08:16.136" style="s2">approved of.</p>
<p begin="01:08:24.836" end="01:08:27.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you for today.</p>
<p begin="01:08:26.836" end="01:08:29.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For what?</p>
<p begin="01:08:27.936" end="01:08:33.036" style="s2">I wasn&#39;t standing up for you. I was</p>
<p begin="01:08:29.836" end="01:08:33.036" style="s2">saving my own dignity.</p>
<p begin="01:08:38.736" end="01:08:41.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve already lined up a buyer for the</p>
<p begin="01:08:39.836" end="01:08:43.436" style="s2">Yunchi Bay land. Once Shen Ju Xiao&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:08:41.836" end="01:08:45.636" style="s2">project is sunk, the board will kick her</p>
<p begin="01:08:43.436" end="01:08:47.336" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="01:08:45.636" end="01:08:48.636" style="s2">Keep making trouble. Ruin Shu Zhao</p>
<p begin="01:08:47.336" end="01:08:51.936" style="s2">Wang&#39;s reputation and make him Shen Ju</p>
<p begin="01:08:48.636" end="01:08:51.936" style="s2">Xiao&#39;s biggest liability.</p>
<p begin="01:08:52.636" end="01:08:57.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry, Mr. Gu. I&#39;ll take care of</p>
<p begin="01:08:54.536" end="01:08:57.536" style="s2">that kid&#39;s stall tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:09:05.636" end="01:09:09.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you want to destroy Ju Xiao, you&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:09:07.436" end="01:09:10.536" style="s2">have to get past me first.</p>
<p begin="01:09:09.436" end="01:09:12.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve already lined up a buyer for the</p>
<p begin="01:09:10.536" end="01:09:13.836" style="s2">Yunchi Bay land. Once Shen Ju Xiao&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:09:12.336" end="01:09:16.336" style="s2">project is sunk, the board will kick her</p>
<p begin="01:09:13.836" end="01:09:18.036" style="s2">out. Keep making trouble. Ruin Shu Zhao</p>
<p begin="01:09:16.336" end="01:09:19.436" style="s2">Wang&#39;s reputation and make him Shen Ju</p>
<p begin="01:09:18.036" end="01:09:21.436" style="s2">Xiao&#39;s biggest liability.</p>
<p begin="01:09:19.436" end="01:09:24.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You colluded with outsiders to sabotage</p>
<p begin="01:09:21.436" end="01:09:24.336" style="s2">your own project.</p>
<p begin="01:09:24.736" end="01:09:27.137" style="s2">You&#39;re asking for it.</p>
<p begin="01:09:26.636" end="01:09:28.237" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ju Xiao,</p>
<p begin="01:09:27.137" end="01:09:30.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know my way around the wholesale</p>
<p begin="01:09:28.237" end="01:09:34.338" style="s2">market. Boss Chen, I can find witnesses</p>
<p begin="01:09:30.938" end="01:09:34.338" style="s2">will testify you took bribes.</p>
<p begin="01:09:43.137" end="01:09:48.838" style="s2">Did Gu Changze pressure you to lower</p>
<p begin="01:09:45.038" end="01:09:48.838" style="s2">your prices and take kickbacks too?</p>
<p begin="01:09:50.038" end="01:09:54.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That guy knocked my price down by 30%</p>
<p begin="01:09:52.038" end="01:09:55.637" style="s2">last time. Said he&#39;d cut me off if I</p>
<p begin="01:09:54.137" end="01:09:58.238" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t sell.</p>
<p begin="01:09:55.637" end="01:10:01.338" style="s2">Xiao Shu, what should we do?</p>
<p begin="01:09:58.238" end="01:10:01.338" style="s2">We&#39;ll follow your lead.</p>
<p begin="01:10:09.338" end="01:10:15.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Vice President Gu, don&#39;t rush. Listen to</p>
<p begin="01:10:11.938" end="01:10:15.038" style="s2">this recording first.</p>
<p begin="01:10:17.438" end="01:10:21.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He he told me to do it.</p>
<p begin="01:10:21.538" end="01:10:24.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gu Changze, you&#39;ve colluded with</p>
<p begin="01:10:23.338" end="01:10:27.438" style="s2">outsiders, harmed the company&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:10:24.838" end="01:10:29.038" style="s2">interests, and spread malicious rumors.</p>
<p begin="01:10:27.438" end="01:10:30.538" style="s2">The board is voting now to remove you</p>
<p begin="01:10:29.038" end="01:10:32.938" style="s2">immediately and refer the matter to</p>
<p begin="01:10:30.538" end="01:10:32.938" style="s2">legal.</p>
<p begin="01:10:37.137" end="01:10:39.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re just a breakfast vendor. What</p>
<p begin="01:10:38.637" end="01:10:42.938" style="s2">gives you the right?</p>
<p begin="01:10:39.637" end="01:10:42.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve never tried to hurt anyone.</p>
<p begin="01:10:48.338" end="01:10:51.338" style="s2">Hungry?</p>
<p begin="01:10:49.538" end="01:10:54.238" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go home.</p>
<p begin="01:10:51.338" end="01:10:54.238" style="s2">I&#39;ll steam you some buns.</p>
<p begin="01:10:59.238" end="01:11:02.637" style="s2">I saved these for you this morning.</p>
<p begin="01:11:00.938" end="01:11:05.438" style="s2">They&#39;re split and don&#39;t look great, so</p>
<p begin="01:11:02.637" end="01:11:05.438" style="s2">don&#39;t judge them.</p>
<p begin="01:11:11.938" end="01:11:16.738" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss Shu, these are the best buns in the</p>
<p begin="01:11:14.338" end="01:11:16.738" style="s2">world.</p>
<p begin="01:11:40.439" end="01:11:44.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The kid can invest and help expand the</p>
<p begin="01:11:41.839" end="01:11:44.739" style="s2">shop into a chain.</p>
<p begin="01:11:47.639" end="01:11:52.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; CEO, I appreciate the offer,</p>
<p begin="01:11:50.739" end="01:11:54.739" style="s2">but this shop is the legacy my dad left</p>
<p begin="01:11:52.339" end="01:11:56.639" style="s2">me. I have to make it stand on my own. I</p>
<p begin="01:11:54.739" end="01:11:58.039" style="s2">don&#39;t want a big investment.</p>
<p begin="01:11:56.639" end="01:11:59.939" style="s2">If you really want to help, lend me some</p>
<p begin="01:11:58.039" end="01:12:01.539" style="s2">working capital at the bank rate. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:11:59.939" end="01:12:02.939" style="s2">write you an IOU and stamp it with my</p>
<p begin="01:12:01.539" end="01:12:05.039" style="s2">thumbprint.</p>
<p begin="01:12:02.939" end="01:12:07.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; CEO Tao Yang, I&#39;m going to be your wife</p>
<p begin="01:12:05.039" end="01:12:07.539" style="s2">someday.</p>
<p begin="01:12:08.939" end="01:12:12.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s exactly why.</p>
<p begin="01:12:11.139" end="01:12:14.639" style="s2">I can&#39;t let people think I, CEO Tao</p>
<p begin="01:12:12.839" end="01:12:16.739" style="s2">Yang, got where I am by relying on a</p>
<p begin="01:12:14.639" end="01:12:18.539" style="s2">woman.</p>
<p begin="01:12:16.739" end="01:12:19.939" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry, I&#39;ll pay you back in full</p>
<p begin="01:12:18.539" end="01:12:23.539" style="s2">with interest</p>
<p begin="01:12:19.939" end="01:12:23.539" style="s2">and make you steamed buns every day.</p>
<p begin="01:12:25.339" end="01:12:29.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, Boss Xu. Pleasure doing</p>
<p begin="01:12:27.239" end="01:12:29.939" style="s2">business with you.</p>
<p begin="01:12:38.839" end="01:12:44.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, it&#39;s still the same sign, but the</p>
<p begin="01:12:40.839" end="01:12:44.739" style="s2">shop&#39;s bigger than it was in your day.</p>
<p begin="01:12:51.439" end="01:12:55.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss Xu, paying interest on opening day.</p>
<p begin="01:12:53.739" end="01:12:59.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even family keeps accounts straight. A</p>
<p begin="01:12:55.639" end="01:12:59.739" style="s2">loan&#39;s a loan. I&#39;ll pay every cent back.</p>
<p begin="01:13:11.339" end="01:13:15.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good kid.</p>
<p begin="01:13:13.339" end="01:13:17.439" style="s2">Look how far you&#39;ve come.</p>
<p begin="01:13:15.639" end="01:13:20.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These are from our own hens. Let the</p>
<p begin="01:13:17.439" end="01:13:20.839" style="s2">kids have something nourishing.</p>
<p begin="01:13:26.839" end="01:13:30.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For the first few days, free soy milk</p>
<p begin="01:13:28.639" end="01:13:32.340" style="s2">for all our neighbors, as much as you</p>
<p begin="01:13:30.040" end="01:13:32.340" style="s2">want.</p>
<p begin="01:13:37.440" end="01:13:42.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhao Zu, you picked a great wife. She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:13:39.840" end="01:13:43.340" style="s2">beautiful and hardworking.</p>
<p begin="01:13:42.040" end="01:13:46.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s not someone I hired. She&#39;s the</p>
<p begin="01:13:43.340" end="01:13:46.040" style="s2">boss&#39;s wife.</p>
<p begin="01:13:52.540" end="01:13:57.640" style="s2">See that?</p>
<p begin="01:13:54.440" end="01:13:57.640" style="s2">I put your sign back up.</p>
<p begin="01:14:07.740" end="01:14:12.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Big Bro, from now on, every $100 bill we</p>
<p begin="01:14:10.840" end="01:14:16.040" style="s2">earn, we&#39;ll frame them all.</p>
<p begin="01:14:12.940" end="01:14:16.040" style="s2">We&#39;d fill a whole wall.</p>
<p begin="01:14:18.940" end="01:14:22.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You little money grubber.</p>
<p begin="01:14:20.340" end="01:14:25.440" style="s2">We&#39;ll keep one as a keepsake. The rest,</p>
<p begin="01:14:22.540" end="01:14:25.440" style="s2">I&#39;ll save for your schooling.</p>
<p begin="01:14:31.540" end="01:14:33.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look, look.</p>
<p begin="01:14:32.840" end="01:14:35.040" style="s2">These are the breakfast buns from our</p>
<p begin="01:14:33.840" end="01:14:36.240" style="s2">CEO&#39;s family.</p>
<p begin="01:14:35.040" end="01:14:38.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Checking in with the CEO&#39;s favorite</p>
<p begin="01:14:36.240" end="01:14:38.540" style="s2">buns.</p>
<p begin="01:14:46.640" end="01:14:50.340" style="s2">Everyone, they&#39;re handmade and we only</p>
<p begin="01:14:48.640" end="01:14:52.140" style="s2">make so many each day.</p>
<p begin="01:14:50.340" end="01:14:53.940" style="s2">When they&#39;re gone, they&#39;re gone.</p>
<p begin="01:14:52.140" end="01:14:57.340" style="s2">Don&#39;t waste your time in line.</p>
<p begin="01:14:53.940" end="01:14:57.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why not raise the price a little?</p>
<p begin="01:14:57.540" end="01:15:01.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My buns are for people who work hard and</p>
<p begin="01:14:59.540" end="01:15:04.140" style="s2">get up early. Two yuan each. I&#39;m not</p>
<p begin="01:15:01.840" end="01:15:05.840" style="s2">raising the price. If anyone has to go</p>
<p begin="01:15:04.140" end="01:15:07.140" style="s2">to work hungry, I&#39;ll be the first to</p>
<p begin="01:15:05.840" end="01:15:09.440" style="s2">object.</p>
<p begin="01:15:07.140" end="01:15:09.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="01:15:16.240" end="01:15:19.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss Zu, with this kind of buzz, you</p>
<p begin="01:15:17.940" end="01:15:21.540" style="s2">could open 100 shops in a year and go</p>
<p begin="01:15:19.840" end="01:15:24.740" style="s2">public in three.</p>
<p begin="01:15:21.540" end="01:15:24.740" style="s2">Thanks for believing in me.</p>
<p begin="01:15:25.540" end="01:15:29.140" style="s2">But making buns takes skill. The dough</p>
<p begin="01:15:27.440" end="01:15:31.040" style="s2">needs time to rise and the filling has</p>
<p begin="01:15:29.140" end="01:15:32.940" style="s2">to be freshly chopped and seasoned. Rush</p>
<p begin="01:15:31.040" end="01:15:34.542" style="s2">it and it won&#39;t taste the same.</p>
<p begin="01:15:32.940" end="01:15:37.442" style="s2">I&#39;ll focus on making this one shop a</p>
<p begin="01:15:34.542" end="01:15:37.442" style="s2">success first.</p>
<p begin="01:15:45.042" end="01:15:47.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You turned down 3 million? Not even</p>
<p begin="01:15:46.842" end="01:15:49.642" style="s2">tempted?</p>
<p begin="01:15:47.542" end="01:15:51.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Money&#39;s great, but if I spread myself</p>
<p begin="01:15:49.642" end="01:15:54.142" style="s2">too thin, I won&#39;t have time to make the</p>
<p begin="01:15:51.542" end="01:15:54.142" style="s2">dough properly.</p>
<p begin="01:15:56.142" end="01:16:01.942" style="s2">My dad always said, it&#39;s better to earn</p>
<p begin="01:15:58.042" end="01:16:01.942" style="s2">a little less than ruin your reputation.</p>
<p begin="01:16:07.242" end="01:16:11.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bro, I got into Taijing University.</p>
<p begin="01:16:20.042" end="01:16:25.042" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, Xiao Yu got into college. Did you</p>
<p begin="01:16:22.542" end="01:16:25.042" style="s2">hear that?</p>
<p begin="01:16:27.142" end="01:16:31.442" style="s2">Chi Xia, you arranged Xiao Yu&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:16:29.142" end="01:16:33.042" style="s2">scholarship, didn&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="01:16:31.442" end="01:16:35.442" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did.</p>
<p begin="01:16:33.042" end="01:16:36.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll pay you back every last cent. And</p>
<p begin="01:16:35.442" end="01:16:39.042" style="s2">I&#39;ll be grateful to you for the rest of</p>
<p begin="01:16:36.642" end="01:16:39.042" style="s2">my life.</p>
<p begin="01:16:39.542" end="01:16:45.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. I&#39;ll be waiting for you to pay me</p>
<p begin="01:16:41.342" end="01:16:45.342" style="s2">back with interest, Bo Chu.</p>
<p begin="01:16:45.942" end="01:16:48.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sis, I&#39;m leaving my brother in your</p>
<p begin="01:16:47.442" end="01:16:50.342" style="s2">hands.</p>
<p begin="01:16:48.542" end="01:16:52.542" style="s2">If he ever gives you a hard time, tell</p>
<p begin="01:16:50.342" end="01:16:52.542" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="01:16:54.042" end="01:16:59.842" style="s2">Dad, I&#39;m going to college. And my</p>
<p begin="01:16:56.142" end="01:16:59.842" style="s2">brother is doing so well now.</p>
<p begin="01:17:07.842" end="01:17:11.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Yu, you got into college? Chu told</p>
<p begin="01:17:10.242" end="01:17:14.442" style="s2">me that when it&#39;s my turn, he&#39;ll help me</p>
<p begin="01:17:11.642" end="01:17:16.142" style="s2">get into Taijing University too.</p>
<p begin="01:17:14.442" end="01:17:18.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure. I&#39;ll be waiting for you at Taijing</p>
<p begin="01:17:16.142" end="01:17:18.642" style="s2">University.</p>
<p begin="01:17:19.642" end="01:17:23.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; People ask me why I insist on taking on</p>
<p begin="01:17:21.642" end="01:17:25.342" style="s2">Yun Chu Bei.</p>
<p begin="01:17:23.142" end="01:17:27.342" style="s2">Here&#39;s what I have to say.</p>
<p begin="01:17:25.342" end="01:17:28.742" style="s2">My fiance</p>
<p begin="01:17:27.342" end="01:17:30.742" style="s2">taught me something.</p>
<p begin="01:17:28.742" end="01:17:32.442" style="s2">He makes buns. He&#39;s up at 3:00 in the</p>
<p begin="01:17:30.742" end="01:17:33.442" style="s2">morning, and even a minute off can ruin</p>
<p begin="01:17:32.442" end="01:17:35.242" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="01:17:33.442" end="01:17:37.343" style="s2">Running a business is just like steaming</p>
<p begin="01:17:35.242" end="01:17:40.543" style="s2">buns. Get the timing right, and the</p>
<p begin="01:17:37.343" end="01:17:40.543" style="s2">results speak for themselves.</p>
<p begin="01:17:41.143" end="01:17:46.843" style="s2">Yunqi Bay is home to over 2,000 seniors.</p>
<p begin="01:17:45.043" end="01:17:48.943" style="s2">Hengsheng promises every household will</p>
<p begin="01:17:46.843" end="01:17:52.643" style="s2">get a new home, and not a hint of the</p>
<p begin="01:17:48.943" end="01:17:52.643" style="s2">old neighborhood&#39;s life will be lost.</p>
<p begin="01:17:55.443" end="01:17:58.843" style="s2">Tao Yan, look.</p>
<p begin="01:17:56.843" end="01:18:00.343" style="s2">This whole area, I plan to preserve it</p>
<p begin="01:17:58.843" end="01:18:01.343" style="s2">just as it is.</p>
<p begin="01:18:00.343" end="01:18:03.443" style="s2">We&#39;ll turn it into a street of</p>
<p begin="01:18:01.343" end="01:18:05.443" style="s2">traditional crafts. We&#39;ll bring back the</p>
<p begin="01:18:03.443" end="01:18:07.943" style="s2">shoe repairers, key cutters, and knife</p>
<p begin="01:18:05.443" end="01:18:10.143" style="s2">sharpeners. I&#39;ve saved the best spot for</p>
<p begin="01:18:07.943" end="01:18:12.543" style="s2">a Shuji breakfast branch.</p>
<p begin="01:18:10.143" end="01:18:12.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For me?</p>
<p begin="01:18:13.243" end="01:18:18.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For everyone on the street who makes a</p>
<p begin="01:18:14.943" end="01:18:18.043" style="s2">living with their hands.</p>
<p begin="01:18:22.843" end="01:18:26.143" style="s2">That&#39;s the everyday life I want to</p>
<p begin="01:18:24.643" end="01:18:29.743" style="s2">protect.</p>
<p begin="01:18:26.143" end="01:18:29.743" style="s2">And he&#39;s the brightest part of it.</p>
<p begin="01:18:31.343" end="01:18:34.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t change the sign. Just give it a</p>
<p begin="01:18:32.543" end="01:18:37.143" style="s2">good polish. It means a lot to your aunt</p>
<p begin="01:18:34.143" end="01:18:40.343" style="s2">and uncle. We can&#39;t let it go.</p>
<p begin="01:18:37.143" end="01:18:40.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kid, you&#39;ve got a good heart.</p>
<p begin="01:18:41.643" end="01:18:46.243" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See that? My son-in-law fixed it up.</p>
<p begin="01:18:44.443" end="01:18:48.043" style="s2">My son-in-law is up at 3:00 every</p>
<p begin="01:18:46.243" end="01:18:49.543" style="s2">morning making the most delicious</p>
<p begin="01:18:48.043" end="01:18:51.443" style="s2">steamed buns.</p>
<p begin="01:18:49.543" end="01:18:52.343" style="s2">And he got my leg back in shape with his</p>
<p begin="01:18:51.443" end="01:18:54.943" style="s2">massages.</p>
<p begin="01:18:52.343" end="01:18:58.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chen, can you still handle that wrench?</p>
<p begin="01:18:54.943" end="01:18:58.543" style="s2">If not, I&#39;ll show you how it&#39;s done.</p>
<p begin="01:19:05.543" end="01:19:10.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sister Wang, your leg healed up fast.</p>
<p begin="01:19:08.343" end="01:19:13.643" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You bet. My son-in-law massages it every</p>
<p begin="01:19:10.543" end="01:19:15.243" style="s2">day. How could it not get better?</p>
<p begin="01:19:13.643" end="01:19:19.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Groom, lean a little closer to the</p>
<p begin="01:19:15.243" end="01:19:22.643" style="s2">bride. Give us a smile. That&#39;s it.</p>
<p begin="01:19:19.043" end="01:19:22.643" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Xu, smile for me.</p>
<p begin="01:19:28.043" end="01:19:33.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shisha, I really am</p>
<p begin="01:19:30.743" end="01:19:33.943" style="s2">your husband now.</p>
<p begin="01:19:34.243" end="01:19:36.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Too late to regret it now.</p>
<p begin="01:19:35.943" end="01:19:39.344" style="s2">The marriage certificate, the The</p>
<p begin="01:19:36.945" end="01:19:39.344" style="s2">certificate.</p>
<p begin="01:19:41.945" end="01:19:46.844" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My biggest regret in life is not meeting</p>
<p begin="01:19:44.244" end="01:19:46.844" style="s2">you sooner.</p>
<p begin="01:19:50.644" end="01:19:53.244" style="s2">I&#39;m married.</p>
<p begin="01:20:02.244" end="01:20:07.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, God. Thank you for blessing</p>
<p begin="01:20:04.945" end="01:20:07.344" style="s2">us.</p>
<p begin="01:20:13.744" end="01:20:17.045" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Shu, starting today, I own half your</p>
<p begin="01:20:16.344" end="01:20:19.945" style="s2">bun stand.</p>
<p begin="01:20:17.045" end="01:20:19.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s our bun stand.</p>
<p begin="01:20:20.744" end="01:20:25.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; President Shen, given your status, we</p>
<p begin="01:20:23.244" end="01:20:26.545" style="s2">recommend this plan, a sky garden and a</p>
<p begin="01:20:25.344" end="01:20:27.644" style="s2">drone show.</p>
<p begin="01:20:26.545" end="01:20:30.144" style="s2">What&#39;s the budget?</p>
<p begin="01:20:27.644" end="01:20:30.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 800</p>
<p begin="01:20:31.744" end="01:20:34.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Could I</p>
<p begin="01:20:32.844" end="01:20:36.144" style="s2">Could I make a suggestion?</p>
<p begin="01:20:34.244" end="01:20:37.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go ahead.</p>
<p begin="01:20:36.144" end="01:20:38.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to have the wedding on Huai Shu</p>
<p begin="01:20:37.344" end="01:20:40.945" style="s2">Street, right outside our family&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:20:38.744" end="01:20:42.744" style="s2">repair shop on that street with a big</p>
<p begin="01:20:40.945" end="01:20:44.144" style="s2">outdoor banquet. My roots are in this</p>
<p begin="01:20:42.744" end="01:20:45.744" style="s2">old neighborhood.</p>
<p begin="01:20:44.144" end="01:20:49.844" style="s2">My dad used to run a stand on Huai Ping</p>
<p begin="01:20:45.744" end="01:20:49.844" style="s2">Road, and we met on Huai Shu Street.</p>
<p begin="01:20:51.244" end="01:20:55.445" style="s2">I want the whole neighborhood to join in</p>
<p begin="01:20:52.644" end="01:20:55.445" style="s2">the celebration.</p>
<p begin="01:20:59.344" end="01:21:02.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your call. Huai Shu Street it is.</p>
<p begin="01:21:01.545" end="01:21:06.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really?</p>
<p begin="01:21:02.244" end="01:21:06.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where your roots are, that&#39;s home to me.</p>
<p begin="01:21:10.244" end="01:21:15.045" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Shu, I&#39;ll bring the tables.</p>
<p begin="01:21:15.445" end="01:21:20.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I &#39;ll take care of the stove and pots. I</p>
<p begin="01:21:17.644" end="01:21:22.644" style="s2">used to be quite the cook.</p>
<p begin="01:21:20.744" end="01:21:25.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look how mischievous she was as a kid.</p>
<p begin="01:21:22.644" end="01:21:28.744" style="s2">Such a mischievous kid.</p>
<p begin="01:21:25.144" end="01:21:28.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just like she is now, stubborn.</p>
<p begin="01:21:29.445" end="01:21:33.644" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Attention, neighbors. Xiao Shu and Xiao</p>
<p begin="01:21:31.545" end="01:21:35.144" style="s2">Yang&#39;s wedding is set.</p>
<p begin="01:21:33.644" end="01:21:38.144" style="s2">We&#39;re throwing an open air banquet right</p>
<p begin="01:21:35.144" end="01:21:40.545" style="s2">here on Huai Shu Street.</p>
<p begin="01:21:38.144" end="01:21:42.345" style="s2">And I declare, as of today, our family</p>
<p begin="01:21:40.545" end="01:21:45.146" style="s2">tradition of pretending to be poor to</p>
<p begin="01:21:42.345" end="01:21:46.946" style="s2">test people is officially over.</p>
<p begin="01:21:45.146" end="01:21:49.345" style="s2">No matter whose kid is dating someone,</p>
<p begin="01:21:46.946" end="01:21:50.845" style="s2">no one is allowed to play poor ever</p>
<p begin="01:21:49.345" end="01:21:52.745" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="01:21:50.845" end="01:21:54.845" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sister Wang, you faked being paralyzed</p>
<p begin="01:21:52.745" end="01:21:56.546" style="s2">back then. Didn&#39;t you put poor Xiao Xu</p>
<p begin="01:21:54.845" end="01:21:59.046" style="s2">through the ringer?</p>
<p begin="01:21:56.546" end="01:22:01.046" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s true. So to punish myself on the</p>
<p begin="01:21:59.046" end="01:22:04.046" style="s2">wedding day, I&#39;ll be pouring tea for the</p>
<p begin="01:22:01.046" end="01:22:04.046" style="s2">whole street.</p>
<p begin="01:22:07.146" end="01:22:09.046" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Xu, taste this. How&#39;s the</p>
<p begin="01:22:08.646" end="01:22:11.546" style="s2">seasoning?</p>
<p begin="01:22:09.046" end="01:22:11.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="01:22:20.745" end="01:22:24.146" style="s2">Chu Tai Yang, tomorrow I&#39;m going to</p>
<p begin="01:22:22.745" end="01:22:26.046" style="s2">marry you.</p>
<p begin="01:22:24.146" end="01:22:29.446" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="01:22:26.046" end="01:22:29.446" style="s2">Tomorrow you&#39;ll be my wife.</p>
<p begin="01:22:32.446" end="01:22:37.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I pretended to be a waitress for so long</p>
<p begin="01:22:35.646" end="01:22:38.946" style="s2">only to realize in the end the girl</p>
<p begin="01:22:37.546" end="01:22:39.946" style="s2">crouching by your stall eating steamed</p>
<p begin="01:22:38.946" end="01:22:42.946" style="s2">buns,</p>
<p begin="01:22:39.946" end="01:22:42.946" style="s2">that was the real me.</p>
<p begin="01:22:45.345" end="01:22:49.446" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then never pretend again. Just be</p>
<p begin="01:22:46.946" end="01:22:50.946" style="s2">yourself. I&#39;ll provide for you.</p>
<p begin="01:22:49.446" end="01:22:52.446" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With what you make, can you really</p>
<p begin="01:22:50.946" end="01:22:54.345" style="s2">afford me?</p>
<p begin="01:22:52.446" end="01:22:56.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can. All the steamed buns you could</p>
<p begin="01:22:54.345" end="01:22:56.745" style="s2">ever eat.</p>
<p begin="01:23:06.646" end="01:23:10.946" style="s2">Study hard and grow up to make a</p>
<p begin="01:23:08.446" end="01:23:10.946" style="s2">difference.</p>
<p begin="01:23:26.345" end="01:23:30.146" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone, thank you for supporting my</p>
<p begin="01:23:28.146" end="01:23:31.845" style="s2">business all these years.</p>
<p begin="01:23:30.146" end="01:23:34.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Xu, we&#39;re the ones who should be</p>
<p begin="01:23:31.845" end="01:23:34.546" style="s2">thanking you.</p>
<p begin="01:23:35.046" end="01:23:40.046" style="s2">Your free soy milk has warmed so many of</p>
<p begin="01:23:37.345" end="01:23:40.046" style="s2">our mornings.</p>
<p begin="01:23:50.047" end="01:23:53.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The bride shouldn&#39;t have to do this.</p>
<p begin="01:23:52.247" end="01:23:57.447" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that your family&#39;s rule? The new</p>
<p begin="01:23:53.747" end="01:23:57.447" style="s2">bride gets to slack off on day one?</p>
<p begin="01:24:05.147" end="01:24:11.147" style="s2">Mr. Shu, from a street stall to a chain,</p>
<p begin="01:24:07.647" end="01:24:11.147" style="s2">what&#39;s been the biggest change for you?</p>
<p begin="01:24:13.747" end="01:24:17.047" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m still Shu Xiao Yong, the guy who</p>
<p begin="01:24:15.147" end="01:24:18.847" style="s2">sells breakfast.</p>
<p begin="01:24:17.047" end="01:24:21.547" style="s2">The shop may be bigger, but the buns</p>
<p begin="01:24:18.847" end="01:24:23.747" style="s2">still cost the same and taste the same.</p>
<p begin="01:24:21.547" end="01:24:25.447" style="s2">When you make food, clean hands mean a</p>
<p begin="01:24:23.747" end="01:24:26.847" style="s2">clean conscience. That&#39;s what my dad</p>
<p begin="01:24:25.447" end="01:24:29.103" style="s2">taught me.</p>
<p begin="01:24:26.847" end="01:24:31.123" style="s2">I&#39;ll never forget it.</p>
<p begin="01:24:29.103" end="01:24:31.123" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="01:24:34.647" end="01:24:37.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hop in,</p>
<p begin="01:24:35.647" end="01:24:37.947" style="s2">wifey.</p>
<p begin="01:24:40.147" end="01:24:43.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ba Shan, you still ride a tricycle? You</p>
<p begin="01:24:41.847" end="01:24:46.547" style="s2">got a problem with my ride?</p>
<p begin="01:24:43.747" end="01:24:47.847" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not at all. No job is beneath anyone. We</p>
<p begin="01:24:46.547" end="01:24:51.747" style="s2">all make a living with our own two</p>
<p begin="01:24:47.847" end="01:24:51.747" style="s2">hands. There&#39;s no shame in that.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
